msgid ""
"Rounds without end, faster each time, with no egg target: play until your "
"baskets are gone. Every fifth cracked egg breaks a basket."
msgstr "没有尽头的轮次，一次比一次快，没有蛋的目标：一直玩到篮子用完。每碎五个蛋就坏一个篮子。"

msgid "Endless meadow"
msgstr "无尽草地"

#. placeholders: {ROUNDS}
msgid ""
"The endless meadow opens once you clear all {ROUNDS} rounds of the meadow."
msgstr "过完草地模式全部{ROUNDS}轮后，无尽草地就会开放。"

#. placeholders: {ROUNDS}
