"but in another place. Ring your row now."
msgstr ""
"{sentence_start}敲响你这一排，学徒会回答。位置对，表示一口钟对了，而且在它的位置上。位置错，表示一口钟在钟序里，但在别的位置。现在敲响你"
"这一排。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Change bells, move between places, and ring until both bells are in place."
msgstr "换钟，在位置之间移动，一直敲，直到两口钟都位置对。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Now find the peal."
msgstr "现在找出钟序。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
msgid ""
"Now find the peal. Change bells, move between places, and ring until both "
"bells are in place. {sentence_start} reads the rows you have rung so far."
msgstr "现在找出钟序。换钟，在位置之间移动，一直敲，直到两口钟都位置对。{sentence_start}读出你到目前为止敲过的每一排。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} reads the rows you have rung so far."
msgstr "{sentence_start}读出你到目前为止敲过的每一排。"

msgid ""
"The old bell ringer left a secret sequence of bells, called a peal. Work "
"out which bells he chose and their order. Ring a guess, and the apprentice "
"answers with clues. Start with a practice sequence of 2 bells"
msgstr ""
"老敲钟人留下了一个钟的秘密顺序，叫作钟序。找出他选了哪些钟，以及它们的顺序。敲响一次猜测，学徒会用线索回答。先从一个2口钟的练习顺序开始"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Each bell appears at most once."
msgstr "每口钟最多出现一次。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Help explains hints and scoring."
msgstr "帮助里会讲解提示和得分。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "In Village, bells can repeat."
msgstr "在乡村模式里，钟可以重复。"

#. placeholders: {places}, {bells}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"The secret sequence contains {places} bells chosen from the {bells} "
"available."
msgstr "秘密顺序由{places}口钟组成，从{bells}口钟里选出。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Try Plain first."
msgstr "先试试简易模式。"

#. placeholders: {places}, {bells}, {rows}
msgid ""
"Try Plain first. The secret sequence contains {places} bells chosen from "
"the {bells} available. You have {rows} guesses to solve it. Each bell "
"appears at most once. In Village, bells can repeat. Help explains hints and "
"scoring."
msgstr ""
"先试试简易模式。秘密顺序由{places}口钟组成，从{bells}口钟里选出。你有{rows}次猜测来解开它。每口钟最多出现一次。在乡村模式里，钟可以"
"重复。帮助里会讲解提示和得分。"

#. placeholders: {rows}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "You have {rows} guesses to solve it."
msgstr "你有{rows}次猜测来解开它。"

#. placeholders: {n}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The peal is found, in {n} rows."
msgstr "找到钟序了，用了{n}排。"

#. placeholders: {row_words}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{row_words}: both in place."
msgstr "{row_words}：两口都位置对。"

#. placeholders: {row_words}, {n}
msgid "{row_words}: both in place. The peal is found, in {n} rows."
msgstr "{row_words}：两口都位置对。找到钟序了，用了{n}排。"

msgid ""
"Walk toward a bird until it sings to you. Whistle its song back note for "
"note to add it to your field guide."
msgstr "朝一只鸟走过去，直到它对你唱歌。一个音一个音地用口哨把它的歌吹回去，就能把它加进你的观鸟图鉴。"

msgid "Walk toward a bird until it sings to you."
msgstr "朝一只鸟走过去，直到它对你唱歌。"

msgid "Whistle its song back note for note to add it to your field guide."
msgstr "一个音一个音地用口哨把它的歌吹回去，就能把它加进你的观鸟图鉴。"

msgid ""
"You cannot fail, and there is no clock. A walk ends when you reach the "
"trail's end or head home. The songs are made for the game from three notes. "
"They are not recordings of real birds."
msgstr "你不会失败，也没有时钟。走到小径尽头或者回家时，这次散步就结束了。这些歌是用三个音为游戏编出来的。它们不是真实鸟类的录音。"

msgid "You cannot fail, and there is no clock."
msgstr "你不会失败，也没有时钟。"

msgid "A walk ends when you reach the trail's end or head home."
msgstr "走到小径尽头或者回家时，这次散步就结束了。"

msgid "The songs are made for the game from three notes."
msgstr "这些歌是用三个音为游戏编出来的。"

msgid "They are not recordings of real birds."
msgstr "它们不是真实鸟类的录音。"

msgid "Finding your way"
msgstr "辨认方向"

msgid ""
"Left and Right turn you one eighth of a circle, and each turn names the way "
"you face: north, north-east, east and so on. The trail runs north from "
"where you start."
msgstr "Left和Right让你转八分之一圈，每次转身都会说出你面朝的方向：北、东北、东，依此类推。小径从你出发的地方往北延伸。"

msgid ""
"Left and Right turn you one eighth of a circle, and each turn names the way "
"you face: north, north-east, east and so on."
msgstr "Left和Right让你转八分之一圈，每次转身都会说出你面朝的方向：北、东北、东，依此类推。"

msgid "The trail runs north from where you start."
msgstr "小径从你出发的地方往北延伸。"

msgid "Every bird sings from its true place around you."
msgstr "每只鸟都从它在你周围的真实位置唱歌。"

msgid ""
"Each trail ends at a landmark: a brook in the woodland, wind chimes on the "
"meadow gate, frogs by the marsh's bird hide, and the weir on the river. "
"Walk toward it to finish."
msgstr "每条小径的尽头都有一个地标：林地里的小溪，草地大门上的风铃，沼泽观鸟屋旁的青蛙，还有河上的堰。朝它走过去就能结束。"

msgid ""
"Each trail ends at a landmark: a brook in the woodland, wind chimes on the "
"meadow gate, frogs by the marsh's bird hide, and the weir on the river."
msgstr "每条小径的尽头都有一个地标：林地里的小溪，草地大门上的风铃，沼泽观鸟屋旁的青蛙，还有河上的堰。"

msgid "Walk toward it to finish."
msgstr "朝它走过去就能结束。"

msgid "Walking"
msgstr "走路"

msgid ""
"Up takes a step forward. Down takes a step back. Hold the key to keep "
"walking. Your footsteps do not disturb the birds."
msgstr "Up向前走一步。Down后退一步。按住键就能一直走。你的脚步声不会惊扰鸟儿。"

msgid "Up takes a step forward."
msgstr "Up向前走一步。"

msgid "Down takes a step back."
msgstr "Down后退一步。"

msgid "Hold the key to keep walking."
msgstr "按住键就能一直走。"

msgid "Your footsteps do not disturb the birds."
msgstr "你的脚步声不会惊扰鸟儿。"

msgid ""
"The game says when you leave the path and when you come back to it. "
"Brambles, a hedge, deep reeds or the river's edge stop you at the sides of "
"the trail, and the game says which way the path is."
msgstr "你离开小路和回到小路时，游戏都会告诉你。荆棘、树篱、深深的芦苇或河岸会在小径两侧挡住你，游戏会告诉你小路在哪边。"

msgid "The game says when you leave the path and when you come back to it."
msgstr "你离开小路和回到小路时，游戏都会告诉你。"

msgid ""
"Brambles, a hedge, deep reeds or the river's edge stop you at the sides of "
"the trail, and the game says which way the path is."
msgstr "荆棘、树篱、深深的芦苇或河岸会在小径两侧挡住你，游戏会告诉你小路在哪边。"

msgid "Meeting a bird"
msgstr "遇见一只鸟"

msgid ""
"Walk toward a song. When you are within a few steps, the bird notices you "
"and sings its song to you alone. The other birds go quiet while it sings."
msgstr "朝歌声走过去。当你走到几步之内，鸟儿会注意到你，只为你唱它的歌。它唱歌时，其他鸟会安静下来。"

msgid "Walk toward a song."
msgstr "朝歌声走过去。"

msgid ""
"When you are within a few steps, the bird notices you and sings its song to "
"you alone."
msgstr "当你走到几步之内，鸟儿会注意到你，只为你唱它的歌。"

msgid "The other birds go quiet while it sings."
msgstr "它唱歌时，其他鸟会安静下来。"

msgid ""
"Space, when no bird is singing to you, names the three birds nearest you, "
"where they are and how far, and the trail's end. H names the nearest bird "
"you have not befriended, where it is, and how to turn to face it."
msgstr ""
"没有鸟在对你唱歌时，Space会说出离你最近的三只鸟、它们在哪里、有多远，以及小径的尽头。H说出离你最近、你还没结交的鸟，它在哪里，以及怎么转身面对它。"

msgid ""
"Space, when no bird is singing to you, names the three birds nearest you, "
"where they are and how far, and the trail's end."
msgstr "没有鸟在对你唱歌时，Space会说出离你最近的三只鸟、它们在哪里、有多远，以及小径的尽头。"

msgid ""
"H names the nearest bird you have not befriended, where it is, and how to "
"turn to face it."
msgstr "H说出离你最近、你还没结交的鸟，它在哪里，以及怎么转身面对它。"

msgid "Answering a song"
msgstr "回应歌声"

msgid ""
"Your turn: Down is low, Space middle, Up high. Songs are 2 to 5 notes."
msgstr "轮到你了：Down是低音，Space是中音，Up是高音。歌有2到5个音。"

msgid "Your turn: Down is low, Space middle, Up high."
msgstr "轮到你了：Down是低音，Space是中音，Up是高音。"

msgid "Songs are 2 to 5 notes."
msgstr "歌有2到5个音。"

msgid ""
"If your answer matches, you befriend the bird. Otherwise, the bird sings "
"again. You can try as often as you like. After two misses, the game names "
"its notes."
msgstr "如果你的回应对上了，你就和这只鸟交上了朋友。否则，鸟儿会再唱一遍。你想试多少次都行。错两次之后，游戏会说出它的音。"

msgid "If your answer matches, you befriend the bird."
msgstr "如果你的回应对上了，你就和这只鸟交上了朋友。"

msgid "Otherwise, the bird sings again."
msgstr "否则，鸟儿会再唱一遍。"

msgid "You can try as often as you like."
msgstr "你想试多少次都行。"

msgid "After two misses, the game names its notes."
msgstr "错两次之后，游戏会说出它的音。"

msgid ""
"While a bird waits for your answer, R makes it sing again, and H names its "
"notes, such as low, high, middle. Turning away or stepping off leaves the "
"bird. Walk a little way off and come back, and it sings to you again."
msgstr "鸟儿等你回应时，R让它再唱一遍，H说出它的音，比如低、高、中。转身离开或走开都会离开这只鸟。走开一小段再回来，它会再为你唱一遍。"

msgid ""
"While a bird waits for your answer, R makes it sing again, and H names its "
"notes, such as low, high, middle."
msgstr "鸟儿等你回应时，R让它再唱一遍，H说出它的音，比如低、高、中。"

msgid "Turning away or stepping off leaves the bird."
msgstr "转身离开或走开都会离开这只鸟。"

msgid "Walk a little way off and come back, and it sings to you again."
msgstr "走开一小段再回来，它会再为你唱一遍。"

msgid ""
"Turn on Spoken call-outs in Settings, from the title or the pause menu, to "
"have the notes of every song named after it."
msgstr "在设置里打开语音播报，可以从标题菜单或暂停菜单进入，每首歌唱完后都会说出它的音。"

msgid "Seasons"
msgstr "季节"

msgid ""
"The birds follow the real calendar, by the seasons of the northern "
"hemisphere."
msgstr "鸟儿跟着真实的日历，按北半球的季节来。"

msgid ""
"In spring the migrants arrive: swallows, warblers, the chiffchaff and the "
"cuckoo. They sing through the summer and leave in autumn. Winter brings "
"visitors from the north, such as juncos, waxwings, redwings and snow "
"buntings. In winter the trails have fewer birds, longer gaps between songs, "
"and snow underfoot."
msgstr ""
"春天候鸟到来：燕子、莺、叽喳柳莺和杜鹃。它们整个夏天都在唱，秋天离开。冬天会有从北方来的访客，比如灯草鹀、太平鸟、白眉歌鸫和雪鹀。冬天小径上的鸟更少，歌"
"声间隔更长，脚下还有雪。"

msgid ""
"In spring the migrants arrive: swallows, warblers, the chiffchaff and the "
"cuckoo."
msgstr "春天候鸟到来：燕子、莺、叽喳柳莺和杜鹃。"

msgid "They sing through the summer and leave in autumn."
msgstr "它们整个夏天都在唱，秋天离开。"

msgid ""
"Winter brings visitors from the north, such as juncos, waxwings, redwings "
"and snow buntings."
msgstr "冬天会有从北方来的访客，比如灯草鹀、太平鸟、白眉歌鸫和雪鹀。"

msgid ""
"In winter the trails have fewer birds, longer gaps between songs, and snow "
"underfoot."
msgstr "冬天小径上的鸟更少，歌声间隔更长，脚下还有雪。"

msgid ""
"At the start of a walk, the game says which bird is new for the season, or "
"which has gone."
msgstr "散步开始时，游戏会说出这个季节新来了哪只鸟，或者哪只已经走了。"

msgid "The trails"
msgstr "小径"

msgid "There are four trails. Each is a habitat with its own birds."
msgstr "一共有四条小径。每条都是一种栖息地，有自己的鸟。"

msgid "There are four trails."
msgstr "一共有四条小径。"

msgid "Each is a habitat with its own birds."
msgstr "每条都是一种栖息地，有自己的鸟。"

msgid "Woodland trail: open from the start."
msgstr "林地小径：一开始就开放。"

msgid "Meadow trail: opens when your field guide holds 4 kinds of bird."
msgstr "草地小径：你的观鸟图鉴收录4种鸟时开放。"

msgid "Marsh trail: opens at 9 kinds of bird."
msgstr "沼泽小径：收录9种鸟时开放。"

msgid "Riverside trail: opens at 15 kinds of bird."
msgstr "河边小径：收录15种鸟时开放。"

msgid ""
"A walk holds 6 birds in spring and summer, 5 in autumn and 4 in winter. "
"Birds with a song you have not learned yet come first."
msgstr "一次散步在春夏有6只鸟，秋天5只，冬天4只。有你还没学会的歌的鸟会先出现。"

msgid ""
"A walk holds 6 birds in spring and summer, 5 in autumn and 4 in winter."
msgstr "一次散步在春夏有6只鸟，秋天5只，冬天4只。"

msgid "Birds with a song you have not learned yet come first."
msgstr "有你还没学会的歌的鸟会先出现。"

msgid "The field guide"
msgstr "观鸟图鉴"

msgid ""
"Every bird you befriend goes into your field guide. Each singing bird has 3 "
"songs to learn: its signature song first, then two variations, one each "
"time you meet it again."
msgstr "你结交的每只鸟都会进入你的观鸟图鉴。每只会唱歌的鸟都有3首歌要学：先是它的招牌歌，然后是两种变奏，每次再遇见它学一种。"

msgid "Every bird you befriend goes into your field guide."
msgstr "你结交的每只鸟都会进入你的观鸟图鉴。"

msgid ""
"Each singing bird has 3 songs to learn: its signature song first, then two "
"variations, one each time you meet it again."
msgstr "每只会唱歌的鸟都有3首歌要学：先是它的招牌歌，然后是两种变奏，每次再遇见它学一种。"

msgid ""
"Read the guide from the Field guide row on the title. Each bird's page "
"plays its song and reads how its song sounds, a line about the bird, how "
"many songs you have learned, and where you first met it. The last row says "
"how many birds are still to meet, and where to look."
msgstr ""
"从标题菜单上的“观鸟图鉴”一行阅读图鉴。每只鸟的那一页会播放它的歌，说明它的歌听起来怎样，一句关于这只鸟的话，你学会了几首歌，以及你第一次在哪里遇见它。"
"最后一行会说还有多少只鸟没遇到，以及该去哪里找。"

msgid "Read the guide from the Field guide row on the title."
msgstr "从标题菜单上的“观鸟图鉴”一行阅读图鉴。"

msgid ""
"Each bird's page plays its song and reads how its song sounds, a line about "
"the bird, how many songs you have learned, and where you first met it."
msgstr "每只鸟的那一页会播放它的歌，说明它的歌听起来怎样，一句关于这只鸟的话，你学会了几首歌，以及你第一次在哪里遇见它。"

msgid ""
"The last row says how many birds are still to meet, and where to look."
msgstr "最后一行会说还有多少只鸟没遇到，以及该去哪里找。"

msgid "Special walks"
msgstr "特别散步"

msgid ""
"Some days of the bird year open a special walk, on the Special walk row of "
"the title. On other days the row is locked, and its help says which walk is "
"next and how many days away it is. Each day counts from the day before to "
"the day after, so it opens in every time zone."
msgstr ""
"观鸟年里有些日子会开放一次特别散步，就在标题菜单的“特别散步”一行。其他日子这一行未解锁，它的帮助会说下一次是哪个散步，还有几天。每个日子从前一天算到后"
"一天，所以每个时区都能赶上。"

msgid ""
"Some days of the bird year open a special walk, on the Special walk row of "
"the title."
msgstr "观鸟年里有些日子会开放一次特别散步，就在标题菜单的“特别散步”一行。"

msgid ""
"On other days the row is locked, and its help says which walk is next and "
"how many days away it is."
msgstr "其他日子这一行未解锁，它的帮助会说下一次是哪个散步，还有几天。"

msgid ""
"Each day counts from the day before to the day after, so it opens in every "
"time zone."
msgstr "每个日子从前一天算到后一天，所以每个时区都能赶上。"

msgid ""
"Dawn chorus, on International Dawn Chorus Day, the first Sunday in May: "
"every bird of the season sings at once, and you pick them out one by one."
msgstr "黎明合唱，在国际黎明合唱日，五月的第一个星期日：这个季节的所有鸟一起唱，你要一只只把它们找出来。"

msgid ""
"Spring migration and autumn migration, on the spring and autumn equinoxes: "
"flocks of geese, cranes and swans fly over, and you count each flock. The "
"migrating flocks can only be met on these walks."
msgstr "春季迁徙和秋季迁徙，在春分和秋分：大雁、鹤和天鹅成群飞过，你要数每一群。迁徙的鸟群只能在这些散步里遇到。"

msgid ""
"Spring migration and autumn migration, on the spring and autumn equinoxes: "
"flocks of geese, cranes and swans fly over, and you count each flock."
msgstr "春季迁徙和秋季迁徙，在春分和秋分：大雁、鹤和天鹅成群飞过，你要数每一群。"

msgid "The migrating flocks can only be met on these walks."
msgstr "迁徙的鸟群只能在这些散步里遇到。"

msgid ""
"Up to 8 birds sing at once, each from its own place around you. You are "
"asked to find one, and its song is described and played alone first. Left "
"and Right turn you to face it. Space picks it."
msgstr ""
"最多8只鸟同时唱歌，每只都在你周围自己的位置上。你会被要求找出其中一只，先单独描述并播放它的歌。Left和Right让你转身面对它。Space选中它。"

msgid "Up to 8 birds sing at once, each from its own place around you."
msgstr "最多8只鸟同时唱歌，每只都在你周围自己的位置上。"

msgid ""
"You are asked to find one, and its song is described and played alone first."
msgstr "你会被要求找出其中一只，先单独描述并播放它的歌。"

msgid "Left and Right turn you to face it."
msgstr "Left和Right让你转身面对它。"

msgid "Space picks it."
msgstr "Space选中它。"

msgid ""
"The right bird flies off, and another bird takes its place. A wrong pick "
"names the bird you chose. R plays the song to find alone again. H says "
"where it is. Each bird you pick out goes into your field guide."
msgstr ""
"选对的鸟会飞走，另一只鸟来接替它的位置。选错的话，会说出你选的那只鸟。R再单独播放一次要找的歌。H说出它在哪里。你找出的每只鸟都会进入你的观鸟图鉴。"

msgid "The right bird flies off, and another bird takes its place."
msgstr "选对的鸟会飞走，另一只鸟来接替它的位置。"

msgid "A wrong pick names the bird you chose."
msgstr "选错的话，会说出你选的那只鸟。"

msgid "R plays the song to find alone again."
msgstr "R再单独播放一次要找的歌。"

msgid "H says where it is."
msgstr "H说出它在哪里。"

msgid "Each bird you pick out goes into your field guide."
msgstr "你找出的每只鸟都会进入你的观鸟图鉴。"

msgid "The migration count"
msgstr "迁徙计数"

msgid ""
"You stand on a hill as flocks fly over, from behind you to ahead in spring, "
"and the other way in autumn. A rush of wings means a flock is coming. Each "
"bird calls once as it passes. Count the calls."
msgstr "你站在山坡上，鸟群从头顶飞过，春天从你身后飞向前方，秋天方向相反。一阵翅膀声表示有一群鸟要来了。每只鸟飞过时叫一声。数叫声。"

msgid ""
"You stand on a hill as flocks fly over, from behind you to ahead in spring, "
"and the other way in autumn."
msgstr "你站在山坡上，鸟群从头顶飞过，春天从你身后飞向前方，秋天方向相反。"

msgid "A rush of wings means a flock is coming."
msgstr "一阵翅膀声表示有一群鸟要来了。"

msgid "Each bird calls once as it passes."
msgstr "每只鸟飞过时叫一声。"

msgid ""
"When the flock has passed, Up and Down set your count. Space gives it. R "
"plays the flock again before you answer. An exact count is 3 points. One "
"off is 1 point. An exact count puts the flock's bird in your field guide."
msgstr ""
"鸟群飞过后，Up和Down设定你的计数。Space给出答案。回答前，R让鸟群再飞一遍。数得准确得3分。差一只得1分。数得准确，这群鸟就会进入你的观鸟图鉴"
"。"

msgid "When the flock has passed, Up and Down set your count."
msgstr "鸟群飞过后，Up和Down设定你的计数。"

msgid "Space gives it."
msgstr "Space给出答案。"

msgid "R plays the flock again before you answer."
msgstr "回答前，R让鸟群再飞一遍。"

msgid "An exact count is 3 points."
msgstr "数得准确得3分。"

msgid "One off is 1 point."
msgstr "差一只得1分。"

msgid "An exact count puts the flock's bird in your field guide."
msgstr "数得准确，这群鸟就会进入你的观鸟图鉴。"

msgid "The practice glade"
msgstr "练习林间空地"

msgid ""
"The practice glade is a short path with two birds: a chickadee just ahead, "
"and a wagtail to your right. Their songs have two notes each. Nothing you "
"do there goes into your field guide."
msgstr "练习林间空地是一条短路，有两只鸟：正前方的山雀，和你右边的鹡鸰。它们的歌各有两个音。你在那里做的一切都不会进入观鸟图鉴。"

msgid ""
"The practice glade is a short path with two birds: a chickadee just ahead, "
"and a wagtail to your right."
msgstr "练习林间空地是一条短路，有两只鸟：正前方的山雀，和你右边的鹡鸰。"

msgid "Their songs have two notes each."
msgstr "它们的歌各有两个音。"

msgid "Nothing you do there goes into your field guide."
msgstr "你在那里做的一切都不会进入观鸟图鉴。"

msgid "The Challenges menu holds 3 challenges, the same for every player."
msgstr "挑战菜单里有3个挑战，所有玩家都一样。"

msgid ""
"Daily, Morning walk: a trail and 5 of its birds, each singing its signature "
"song. 3 points for a bird answered first time, 2 after one miss, 1 after "
"more."
msgstr "每日挑战，清晨散步：一条小径和其中5只鸟，每只唱它的招牌歌。一次答对的鸟得3分，错一次后答对得2分，错更多次得1分。"

msgid ""
"Daily, Morning walk: a trail and 5 of its birds, each singing its signature "
"song."
msgstr "每日挑战，清晨散步：一条小径和其中5只鸟，每只唱它的招牌歌。"

msgid ""
"3 points for a bird answered first time, 2 after one miss, 1 after more."
msgstr "一次答对的鸟得3分，错一次后答对得2分，错更多次得1分。"

msgid ""
"Weekly, Chorus week: 8 birds of the season sing at once. Pick out each one: "
"2 points first time, 1 after a miss."
msgstr "每周挑战，合唱周：这个季节的8只鸟一起唱。把每一只找出来：一次找对得2分，错一次后得1分。"

msgid "Weekly, Chorus week: 8 birds of the season sing at once."
msgstr "每周挑战，合唱周：这个季节的8只鸟一起唱。"

msgid "Pick out each one: 2 points first time, 1 after a miss."
msgstr "把每一只找出来：一次找对得2分，错一次后得1分。"

msgid ""
"Monthly, The great count: 8 flocks of up to 12 birds. 3 points for an exact "
"count, 1 for one off."
msgstr "每月挑战，大计数：8群鸟，每群最多12只。数得准确得3分，差一只得1分。"

msgid "Monthly, The great count: 8 flocks of up to 12 birds."
msgstr "每月挑战，大计数：8群鸟，每群最多12只。"

msgid "3 points for an exact count, 1 for one off."
msgstr "数得准确得3分，差一只得1分。"

msgid ""
"Before you start, each reads its rule and when the next one comes. Escape "
"on that briefing goes back without starting. Reaching the end, or heading "
"home, counts toward your streak. Leave the challenge, on the pause menu, "
"does not."
msgstr ""
"开始前，每个挑战都会读出它的规则，以及下一个什么时候来。在简报上按Escape不开局直接返回。走到尽头或回家，都会计入你的连胜。暂停菜单里的“离开挑战”"
"不算。"

msgid "Before you start, each reads its rule and when the next one comes."
msgstr "开始前，每个挑战都会读出它的规则，以及下一个什么时候来。"

msgid "Escape on that briefing goes back without starting."
msgstr "在简报上按Escape不开局直接返回。"

msgid "Reaching the end, or heading home, counts toward your streak."
msgstr "走到尽头或回家，都会计入你的连胜。"

msgid "Leave the challenge, on the pause menu, does not."
msgstr "暂停菜单里的“离开挑战”不算。"

msgid "Records and results"
msgstr "纪录和结算"

msgid ""
"When a walk ends, the results name the birds you befriended, the new songs, "
"and your field guide's total. Then the results menu offers Play again, Hear "
"the results again, the Field guide, and Back to the title. Escape does the "
"same as the last row."
msgstr ""
"散步结束时，结算会说出你结交的鸟、新学的歌，以及你观鸟图鉴的总数。然后结算菜单提供再来一局、再听一遍结算、观鸟图鉴和回到标题菜单。Escape和最后一行"
"的作用一样。"

msgid ""
"When a walk ends, the results name the birds you befriended, the new songs, "
"and your field guide's total."
msgstr "散步结束时，结算会说出你结交的鸟、新学的歌，以及你观鸟图鉴的总数。"

msgid ""
"Then the results menu offers Play again, Hear the results again, the Field "
"guide, and Back to the title."
msgstr "然后结算菜单提供再来一局、再听一遍结算、观鸟图鉴和回到标题菜单。"

msgid ""
"Records, on the title, reads your field guide's totals, your walks and "
"steps, your best dawn chorus and migration count, and your challenge "
"results."
msgstr "标题菜单上的纪录会读出你观鸟图鉴的总数、你的散步和步数、你最好的黎明合唱和迁徙计数，以及你的挑战成绩。"

msgid "Sound check and tutorial"
msgstr "音效试听和教程"

msgid ""
"Sound check, on the title, plays each sound you need on the trail: your "
"whistle, each bird voice with its low, middle and high notes, the flock "
"calls, the cues and the sounds at each trail's end. Tutorial explains the "
"game a page at a time."
msgstr ""
"标题菜单上的音效试听会播放小径上需要的每个声音：你的口哨，每种鸟的声音及其低、中、高音，鸟群的叫声，提示音，还有每条小径尽头的声音。教程一次一页地讲解游"
"戏。"

msgid ""
"Sound check, on the title, plays each sound you need on the trail: your "
"whistle, each bird voice with its low, middle and high notes, the flock "
"calls, the cues and the sounds at each trail's end."
msgstr "标题菜单上的音效试听会播放小径上需要的每个声音：你的口哨，每种鸟的声音及其低、中、高音，鸟群的叫声，提示音，还有每条小径尽头的声音。"

msgid "Tutorial explains the game a page at a time."
msgstr "教程一次一页地讲解游戏。"

msgid ""
"Left and Right arrows: turn. In the migration count, change your count."
msgstr "Left和Right方向键：转身。在迁徙计数里，更改你的计数。"

msgid "Left and Right arrows: turn."
msgstr "Left和Right方向键：转身。"

msgid "In the migration count, change your count."
msgstr "在迁徙计数里，更改你的计数。"

msgid ""
"Up arrow: step forward. When a bird waits for your answer, the high note. "
"In the migration count, count up."
msgstr "Up方向键：向前走一步。鸟儿等你回应时，是高音。在迁徙计数里，计数加一。"

msgid "Up arrow: step forward."
msgstr "Up方向键：向前走一步。"

msgid "When a bird waits for your answer, the high note."
msgstr "鸟儿等你回应时，是高音。"

msgid "In the migration count, count up."
msgstr "在迁徙计数里，计数加一。"

msgid ""
"Down arrow: step back. When a bird waits for your answer, the low note. In "
"the migration count, count down."
msgstr "Down方向键：后退一步。鸟儿等你回应时，是低音。在迁徙计数里，计数减一。"

msgid "Down arrow: step back."
msgstr "Down方向键：后退一步。"

msgid "When a bird waits for your answer, the low note."
msgstr "鸟儿等你回应时，是低音。"

msgid "In the migration count, count down."
msgstr "在迁徙计数里，计数减一。"

msgid ""
"Space: name the birds around you. When a bird waits for your answer, the "
"middle note. In the dawn chorus, pick the bird you face. In the migration "
"count, give your count."
msgstr "Space：说出你周围的鸟。鸟儿等你回应时，是中音。在黎明合唱里，选中你面对的鸟。在迁徙计数里，给出你的计数。"

msgid "Space: name the birds around you."
msgstr "Space：说出你周围的鸟。"

msgid "When a bird waits for your answer, the middle note."
msgstr "鸟儿等你回应时，是中音。"

msgid "In the dawn chorus, pick the bird you face."
msgstr "在黎明合唱里，选中你面对的鸟。"

msgid "In the migration count, give your count."
msgstr "在迁徙计数里，给出你的计数。"

msgid "Tab: head home. Press it twice. Any other key cancels."
msgstr "Tab：回家。按两次。按其他任何键取消。"

msgid "Tab: head home."
msgstr "Tab：回家。"

msgid "Press it twice."
msgstr "按两次。"

msgid "Any other key cancels."
msgstr "按其他任何键取消。"

msgid ""
"S: status. The bird you are with, which way you face, and where the trail's "
"end is. Press it again straight away for the trail and season and the birds "
"befriended."
msgstr "S：状态。你身边的鸟、你面朝哪边，以及小径尽头在哪里。马上再按一次，听小径、季节和已结交的鸟。"

msgid "S: status."
msgstr "S：状态。"

msgid ""
"The bird you are with, which way you face, and where the trail's end is."
msgstr "你身边的鸟、你面朝哪边，以及小径尽头在哪里。"

msgid ""
"Press it again straight away for the trail and season and the birds "
"befriended."
msgstr "马上再按一次，听小径、季节和已结交的鸟。"

msgid ""
"R: repeat. The bird sings again, or the last thing said is repeated. In the "
"chorus, the song to find plays alone. In the count, the flock flies over "
"again."
msgstr "R：重复。鸟儿再唱一遍，或者重复上一句话。在合唱里，单独播放要找的歌。在计数里，鸟群再飞过一遍。"

msgid "R: repeat."
msgstr "R：重复。"

msgid "The bird sings again, or the last thing said is repeated."
msgstr "鸟儿再唱一遍，或者重复上一句话。"

msgid "In the chorus, the song to find plays alone."
msgstr "在合唱里，单独播放要找的歌。"

msgid "In the count, the flock flies over again."
msgstr "在计数里，鸟群再飞过一遍。"

msgid ""
"H: hint. Where the nearest new bird is and how to turn to it, or the notes "
"of the song."
msgstr "H：提示。最近的新鸟在哪里以及怎么转向它，或者歌的音。"

msgid "H: hint."
msgstr "H：提示。"

msgid ""
"Where the nearest new bird is and how to turn to it, or the notes of the "
"song."
msgstr "最近的新鸟在哪里以及怎么转向它，或者歌的音。"

msgid ""
"Escape: pause. The pause menu can resume, open settings or this help, go "
"back to the title, or go back to the lobby. During a challenge, its leave "
"row is Leave the challenge."
msgstr "Escape：暂停。暂停菜单可以继续、打开设置或这份帮助、回到标题菜单，或者回到大厅。挑战中，离开那一行是“离开挑战”。"

msgid "Escape: pause."
msgstr "Escape：暂停。"

msgid ""
"The pause menu can resume, open settings or this help, go back to the "
"title, or go back to the lobby."
msgstr "暂停菜单可以继续、打开设置或这份帮助、回到标题菜单，或者回到大厅。"

msgid "During a challenge, its leave row is Leave the challenge."
msgstr "挑战中，离开那一行是“离开挑战”。"

msgid "F1: what the keys do on the current screen."
msgstr "F1：当前界面上各个键的作用。"

msgid "middle"
msgstr "中"

msgid "mid"
msgstr "中"

msgid "whistle"
msgstr "哨音"

msgid "flute"
msgstr "笛音"

msgid "trill"
msgstr "颤音"

msgid "piping"
msgstr "尖细声"

msgid "reed"
msgstr "簧音"

msgid "tinkle"
msgstr "叮铃声"

msgid "coo"
msgstr "咕咕声"

msgid "hoot"
msgstr "呜呜声"

msgid "drum"
msgstr "敲击声"

msgid "honk"
msgstr "嘎嘎声"

msgid "bugle"
msgstr "号角声"

msgid "whoop"
msgstr "长鸣"

msgid "clear, sliding whistles"
msgstr "清亮滑动的哨音"

msgid "soft, breathy fluting"
msgstr "轻柔带气声的笛音"

msgid "quick, rattling trills"
msgstr "急促嘎嘎的颤音"

msgid "round, piping notes"
msgstr "圆润尖细的音"

msgid "buzzy, reedy notes"
msgstr "嗡嗡的簧音"

msgid "thin, tinkling notes"
msgstr "细细的叮铃声"

msgid "soft, low cooing"
msgstr "轻柔低沉的咕咕声"

msgid "deep, hollow hoots"
msgstr "深沉空洞的呜呜声"

msgid "a drumroll on hollow wood"
msgstr "在空心木头上的一阵敲击"

msgid "a goose's honk"
msgstr "大雁的嘎嘎声"

msgid "a crane's rolling bugle"
msgstr "鹤滚动的号角声"

msgid "a swan's whooping call"
msgstr "天鹅的长鸣"

msgid "robin"
msgstr "知更鸟"

msgid "a run of clear, wistful whistles that tumble and rise"
msgstr "一串清亮又带点惆怅的哨音，翻滚着上扬"

msgid ""
"A robin is often the first to sing in the morning and the last at dusk."
msgstr "知更鸟常常是早上最先唱、黄昏最后唱的鸟。"

msgid "wren"
msgstr "鹪鹩"

msgid ""
"a loud, rapid rattle of bright notes, far too big for so small a bird"
msgstr "一串响亮急促的明亮音符，对这么小的鸟来说大得出奇"

msgid ""
"The wren is one of the smallest birds on the trail, and one of the loudest."
msgstr "鹪鹩是小径上最小的鸟之一，也是最响亮的之一。"

msgid "blackbird"
msgstr "乌鸫"

msgid ""
"a slow, mellow fluting, unhurried, like someone humming to themselves"
msgstr "缓慢圆润的笛音，不慌不忙，像有人在自顾自地哼歌"

msgid "Blackbirds like a high perch for singing as the light comes up."
msgstr "乌鸫喜欢在天亮时站在高处唱歌。"

msgid "song-thrush"
msgstr ""

msgid "song thrush"
msgstr "欧歌鸫"

msgid ""
"each phrase sung twice or three times over, as if to be sure you heard it"
msgstr "每个乐句都唱两三遍，好像要确定你听见了"

msgid "A song thrush cracks snail shells open on a favourite stone."
msgstr "欧歌鸫会在一块心爱的石头上把蜗牛壳敲开。"

msgid "chickadee"
msgstr "山雀"

msgid "two sweet, clear notes, the second a little lower: fee, bee"
msgstr "两个甜美清亮的音，第二个稍低：啡，比"

msgid "Chickadees stay all winter, and tuck seeds away to find later."
msgstr "山雀整个冬天都留下来，还会把种子藏起来留着以后找。"

msgid "cardinal"
msgstr "北美红雀"

msgid "bright, sliding whistles, repeated: cheer, cheer, cheer"
msgstr "明亮滑动的哨音，一再重复：起儿，起儿，起儿"

msgid "Cardinals sing all year round, and both partners of a pair sing."
msgstr "北美红雀一年四季都唱，一对里的两只都会唱。"

msgid "great-tit"
msgstr ""

msgid "great tit"
msgstr "大山雀"

msgid "a ringing two-note seesaw: teacher, teacher, teacher"
msgstr "响亮的两音来回摇摆：嘀嘿，嘀嘿，嘀嘿"

msgid ""
"Great tits have dozens of different calls, and each bird knows several "
"songs."
msgstr "大山雀有几十种不同的叫声，每只都会好几首歌。"

msgid "nuthatch"
msgstr "䴓"

msgid ""
"a quick, even run of piping notes, like a tiny whistle blown again and again"
msgstr "一串快速均匀的尖细音，像小哨子吹了一遍又一遍"

msgid "A nuthatch can walk down a tree trunk head first."
msgstr "䴓能头朝下沿着树干往下走。"

msgid "woodpecker"
msgstr "啄木鸟"

msgid "great spotted woodpecker"
msgstr "大斑啄木鸟"

msgid "a fast drumroll on a hollow branch, fading as it goes"
msgstr "在空心树枝上一阵快速的敲击，越来越弱"

msgid ""
"A woodpecker drums instead of singing, choosing the branch that rings best."
msgstr "啄木鸟不唱歌，而是敲击，还会挑声音最响的树枝。"

msgid "chiffchaff"
msgstr "叽喳柳莺"

msgid "two notes swapped back and forth, saying its own name: chiff, chaff"
msgstr "两个音来回交替，说着自己的名字：叽，喳"

msgid "The chiffchaff is one of the first migrants back each spring."
msgstr "叽喳柳莺是每年春天最早回来的候鸟之一。"

msgid "blackcap"
msgstr "黑顶林莺"

msgid "a rich, hurried warble that ends in a bright flourish"
msgstr "一段丰富急促的啭鸣，最后是一个明亮的花腔"

msgid ""
"Blackcaps arrive in spring and fill the woods with song from deep in the "
"leaves."
msgstr "黑顶林莺春天到来，在深深的树叶间让树林里满是歌声。"

msgid "willow-warbler"
msgstr ""

msgid "willow warbler"
msgstr "欧柳莺"

msgid "a soft, sweet cascade that slides gently down the scale"
msgstr "一串轻柔甜美的音，沿着音阶缓缓滑下"

msgid ""
"A willow warbler weighs about as much as two coins, yet flies to Africa and "
"back each year."
msgstr "欧柳莺大约只有两枚硬币那么重，却每年往返非洲一趟。"

msgid "wood-thrush"
msgstr ""

msgid "wood thrush"
msgstr "棕林鸫"

msgid "a flute-like ee-oh-lay, with a soft trill at the end"
msgstr "笛子般的咿哦嘞，最后带一个轻柔的颤音"

msgid ""
"A wood thrush can sing two notes at once, one from each side of its voice "
"box."
msgstr "棕林鸫能同时唱两个音，鸣管两边各出一个。"

msgid "cuckoo"
msgstr "大杜鹃"

msgid "two soft, hollow notes, high then low: cuck, oo"
msgstr "两个轻柔空洞的音，先高后低：布，谷"

msgid "The cuckoo's call is heard for only a few weeks each spring."
msgstr "每年春天，杜鹃的叫声只能听到几个星期。"

msgid "redwing"
msgstr "白眉歌鸫"

msgid "a thin, high seep, then a short, scratchy run"
msgstr "一声细高的嘶声，然后是一小串沙哑的音"

msgid ""
"Redwings come from the far north for the winter, travelling in loose, "
"chattering flocks."
msgstr "白眉歌鸫从遥远的北方来过冬，结成松散又叽叽喳喳的鸟群迁徙。"

msgid "junco"
msgstr "灯草鹀"

msgid "dark-eyed junco"
msgstr "暗眼灯草鹀"

msgid "a steady, musical trill, all on one note"
msgstr "一串平稳悦耳的颤音，全在一个音上"

msgid ""
"Juncos are often called snowbirds, because they arrive with the first snow."
msgstr "灯草鹀常被叫作雪鸟，因为它们随着初雪一起到来。"

msgid "waxwing"
msgstr "太平鸟"

msgid "a thin, high, ringing trill, sung by the whole flock together"
msgstr "一串细高响亮的颤音，整群鸟一起唱"

msgid ""
"Waxwings wander in winter wherever the berries are, and strip a bush in an "
"afternoon."
msgstr "太平鸟冬天哪里有浆果就飘到哪里，一个下午就能把一丛灌木吃光。"

msgid "skylark"
msgstr "云雀"

msgid "a long, bubbling stream of song from high overhead, going on and on"
msgstr "从高空传来一长串冒泡似的歌声，没完没了"

msgid ""
"A skylark sings as it climbs, hanging in the air until it is only a voice "
"in the sky."
msgstr "云雀边飞升边唱，悬在空中，直到只剩天上的一个声音。"

msgid "meadowlark"
msgstr "草地鹨"

msgid "a few clear, flute-like whistles that end in a gentle tumble"
msgstr "几声清亮如笛的哨音，最后轻轻一翻"

msgid ""
"A meadowlark sings from a fence post with its bright chest to the sun."
msgstr "草地鹨站在篱笆桩上唱歌，明黄的胸脯朝着太阳。"

msgid "goldfinch"
msgstr "金翅雀"

msgid "a light, twittering tinkle, like a handful of small bells"
msgstr "一阵轻快的叽喳叮铃声，像一把小铃铛"

msgid ""
"Goldfinches love thistle seed, and gather in little chattering groups."
msgstr "金翅雀爱吃蓟的种子，常聚成叽叽喳喳的小群。"

msgid "yellowhammer"
msgstr "黄鹀"

msgid ""
"a row of quick, short notes and one long one: a little bit of bread and no "
"cheese"
msgstr "一串短促的音，最后一个长音：一点点面包，不要奶酪"

msgid ""
"A yellowhammer sings from the top of a hedge, all through the warm "
"afternoons."
msgstr "黄鹀站在树篱顶上唱歌，唱过一个个温暖的下午。"

msgid "swallow"
msgstr "燕子"

msgid "barn swallow"
msgstr "家燕"

msgid "a fast, cheerful twitter with a dry rattle in the middle"
msgstr "一阵快活急促的叽喳声，中间夹着一声干涩的嘎嘎"

msgid ""
"Swallows arrive in spring, nest in barns, and leave for the south in autumn."
msgstr "燕子春天到来，在谷仓里筑巢，秋天飞往南方。"

msgid "bobolink"
msgstr "刺歌雀"

msgid "a bubbling, tumbling jumble of notes, like a tune played on a toy"
msgstr "一团冒泡翻滚的杂乱音符，像玩具上弹出的曲调"

msgid ""
"Bobolinks nest in tall grass and fly to South America for the winter."
msgstr "刺歌雀在高草里筑巢，冬天飞到南美洲。"

msgid "indigo-bunting"
msgstr ""

msgid "indigo bunting"
msgstr "靛蓝彩鹀"

msgid "bright notes in pairs, each pair a little different from the last"
msgstr "成对的明亮音符，每一对都和上一对稍有不同"

msgid "Indigo buntings migrate by night and steer by the stars."
msgstr "靛蓝彩鹀在夜里迁徙，靠星星辨认方向。"

msgid "song-sparrow"
msgstr ""

msgid "song sparrow"
msgstr "歌带鹀"

msgid "three or four clear opening notes, then a jumbled, cheerful trill"
msgstr "开头三四个清亮的音，然后是一串杂乱快活的颤音"

msgid ""
"A young song sparrow learns its tunes by listening to its neighbours."
msgstr "年轻的歌带鹀靠听邻居唱歌来学曲调。"

msgid "mourning-dove"
msgstr ""

msgid "mourning dove"
msgstr "哀鸽"

msgid "a soft, sad cooing, low and slow"
msgstr "轻柔哀伤的咕咕声，低沉而缓慢"

msgid "Mourning doves coo so softly that people often take them for owls."
msgstr "哀鸽的咕咕声很轻，人们常把它们当成猫头鹰。"

msgid "snow-bunting"
msgstr ""

msgid "snow bunting"
msgstr "雪鹀"

msgid "a soft, rippling twitter as the flock lifts off the field"
msgstr "鸟群从田野上飞起时一阵轻柔起伏的叽喳声"

msgid "Snow buntings swirl over winter fields like a flurry of snowflakes."
msgstr "雪鹀在冬天的田野上盘旋，像一阵飞舞的雪花。"

msgid "fieldfare"
msgstr "田鸫"

msgid "a harsh, chuckling chack, chack, as the flock passes over"
msgstr "鸟群飞过时一阵粗哑的咯咯声：嚓，嚓"

msgid ""
"Fieldfares come south for the winter and roam the fields in noisy bands."
msgstr "田鸫冬天往南来，成群结队吵吵闹闹地在田野上游荡。"

msgid "red-winged-blackbird"
msgstr ""

msgid "red-winged blackbird"
msgstr "红翅黑鹂"

msgid "a gurgling conk-la-ree, ending in a buzzing trill"
msgstr "一声咕噜噜的扣啦哩，最后是一串嗡嗡的颤音"

msgid ""
"Red-winged blackbirds claim a reed each spring and sing from the top of it."
msgstr "红翅黑鹂每年春天占下一根芦苇，站在顶上唱歌。"

msgid "reed-warbler"
msgstr ""

msgid "reed warbler"
msgstr "芦苇莺"

msgid "a steady, chattering churr, like a little engine among the reeds"
msgstr "一阵平稳絮叨的啾啾声，像芦苇丛里的小马达"

msgid "A reed warbler weaves its nest around three or four reed stems."
msgstr "芦苇莺把巢编在三四根芦苇茎上。"

msgid "sedge-warbler"
msgstr ""

msgid "sedge warbler"
msgstr "水蒲苇莺"

msgid "a scratchy, hurried medley with bright whistles thrown in"
msgstr "一段沙哑急促的混合曲，夹着几声明亮的哨音"

msgid "A sedge warbler never sings quite the same song twice."
msgstr "水蒲苇莺从来不会把同一首歌唱得一模一样。"

msgid "marsh-wren"
msgstr ""

msgid "marsh wren"
msgstr "长嘴沼泽鹪鹩"

msgid "a gurgle, then a fast, rattling buzz, over and over"
msgstr "一声咕噜，然后是一阵急促嘎嘎的嗡嗡声，一遍又一遍"

msgid "A marsh wren builds several nests, and lets its mate choose one."
msgstr "长嘴沼泽鹪鹩会筑好几个巢，让伴侣挑一个。"

msgid "yellowthroat"
msgstr "黄喉地莺"

msgid "common yellowthroat"
msgstr "普通黄喉地莺"

msgid "a rolling, repeated witchety, witchety, witchety"
msgstr "一串翻滚重复的维切蒂，维切蒂，维切蒂"

msgid ""
"The yellowthroat wears a black mask, like a tiny bandit in the reeds."
msgstr "黄喉地莺戴着黑色面罩，像芦苇丛里的小强盗。"

msgid "reed-bunting"
msgstr ""

msgid "reed bunting"
msgstr "芦鹀"

msgid ""
"a short, simple song of a few notes, stopping almost before it starts"
msgstr "几个音组成的一小段简单的歌，几乎刚开始就停了"

msgid "Reed buntings sit on a tall stem and sway with it in the wind."
msgstr "芦鹀停在高高的茎上，随风摇摆。"

msgid "bittern"
msgstr "大麻鳽"

msgid "a deep, hollow boom, like someone blowing across a bottle"
msgstr "一声低沉空洞的轰鸣，像有人对着瓶口吹气"

msgid ""
"A bittern's boom carries for miles, but the bird itself is almost never "
"seen."
msgstr "大麻鳽的轰鸣能传好几英里，但几乎没人见过这种鸟本身。"

msgid "water-rail"
msgstr ""

msgid "water rail"
msgstr "西方秧鸡"

msgid "a sudden squeal and a few grunts, like a small piglet in the reeds"
msgstr "一声突然的尖叫和几声哼哼，像芦苇丛里的小猪"

msgid ""
"Water rails slip between the reed stems, thin enough to pass where nothing "
"else can."
msgstr "西方秧鸡在芦苇茎之间溜过，身子细得能钻过别的东西钻不过的地方。"

msgid "kingfisher"
msgstr "翠鸟"

msgid "a sharp, shrill whistle as it darts low over the water"
msgstr "贴着水面低飞时一声尖利的哨音"

msgid ""
"A kingfisher watches from a low branch, then dives straight in for a fish."
msgstr "翠鸟在低枝上观察，然后一头扎进水里抓鱼。"

msgid "dipper"
msgstr "河乌"

msgid "a sweet, scratchy warble that carries over rushing water"
msgstr "一段甜美又沙哑的啭鸣，能盖过湍急的水声"

msgid "A dipper walks along the stream bed underwater, looking for insects."
msgstr "河乌会在水下沿着溪床行走，寻找虫子。"

msgid "grey-wagtail"
msgstr ""

msgid "grey wagtail"
msgstr "灰鹡鸰"

msgid "a sharp, metallic call, two notes quick together"
msgstr "一声尖锐的金属般的叫声，两个音紧挨着"

msgid "A grey wagtail bobs its long tail all the time, from rock to rock."
msgstr "灰鹡鸰从一块石头跳到另一块，长尾巴一直上下摆动。"

msgid "sand-martin"
msgstr ""

msgid "sand martin"
msgstr "崖沙燕"

msgid "a dry, buzzy twitter as it skims the river"
msgstr "掠过河面时一阵干涩嗡嗡的叽喳声"

msgid "Sand martins dig their nests in the soft earth of the riverbank."
msgstr "崖沙燕在河岸松软的泥土里挖洞筑巢。"

msgid "sandpiper"
msgstr "矶鹬"

msgid "common sandpiper"
msgstr "矶鹬"

msgid "thin, high piping notes, three at a time, as it flies low"
msgstr "低飞时细高的尖细音，一次三个"

msgid ""
"A sandpiper flies with stiff, flickering wings, just above the water."
msgstr "矶鹬贴着水面飞，翅膀僵直地快速扇动。"

msgid "yellow-warbler"
msgstr ""

msgid "yellow warbler"
msgstr "黄林莺"

msgid "bright, quick notes that rush to the end: sweet, sweet, I'm so sweet"
msgstr "明亮急促的音，一路冲到结尾：甜，甜，我好甜"

msgid ""
"Yellow warblers nest in the willows by the water, and sing from dawn to "
"dusk."
msgstr "黄林莺在水边的柳树上筑巢，从黎明唱到黄昏。"

msgid "oriole"
msgstr "拟鹂"

msgid "Baltimore oriole"
msgstr "橙腹拟鹂"

msgid "rich, clear whistles, like a short tune on a wooden flute"
msgstr "圆润清亮的哨音，像木笛吹出的一小段曲子"

msgid ""
"An oriole weaves a hanging nest, like a little bag, at the end of a branch."
msgstr "拟鹂在树枝末端编一个吊巢，像个小口袋。"

msgid "siskin"
msgstr "黄雀"

msgid "a twittering, wheezy song from the tops of the alders"
msgstr "从桤木顶上传来一阵叽喳又带喘息的歌"

msgid "Siskins hang upside down on alder cones to pick out the seeds."
msgstr "黄雀会倒挂在桤木的球果上啄出种子。"

msgid "canada-goose"
msgstr ""

msgid "Canada goose"
msgstr "加拿大黑雁"

msgid "loud, cheerful honks, each bird answering the others"
msgstr "响亮快活的嘎嘎声，每只鸟都在回应其他鸟"

msgid ""
"Geese fly in a long V, taking turns at the front where the work is hardest."
msgstr "大雁排成长长的V字飞行，轮流飞在最辛苦的最前面。"

msgid "sandhill-crane"
msgstr ""

msgid "sandhill crane"
msgstr "沙丘鹤"

msgid "a rolling, rattling bugle that carries for miles"
msgstr "一阵滚动嘎嘎的号角声，能传好几英里"

msgid ""
"Sandhill cranes are one of the oldest kinds of bird still flying today."
msgstr "沙丘鹤是如今还在飞的最古老的鸟类之一。"

msgid "whooper-swan"
msgstr ""

msgid "whooper swan"
msgstr "大天鹅"

msgid "soft, bugling whoops, like a brass band warming up"
msgstr "轻柔的号角般长鸣，像铜管乐队在热身"

msgid "Whooper swans call to keep the family together on the long flight."
msgstr "大天鹅在漫长的飞行中互相呼唤，好让一家子待在一起。"

msgid "pink-footed-goose"
msgstr ""

msgid "pink-footed goose"
msgstr "粉脚雁"

msgid "high, yapping honks, wink wink, from a great skein of birds"
msgstr "一大群鸟发出高亢的尖嘎声，温克，温克"

msgid "Pink-footed geese travel in huge flocks, thousands of birds at once."
msgstr "粉脚雁成大群迁徙，一次就是成千上万只。"

#. placeholders: {name}
msgid "an {name}"
msgstr ""

msgid "Morning walk"
msgstr "清晨散步"

msgid "Chorus week"
msgstr "合唱周"

msgid "The great count"
msgstr "大计数"

#. placeholders: {name}, {name2}, {birds}
msgid "the {name} in {name2}, {birds} birds"
msgstr "{name2}的{name}，{birds}只鸟"

#. placeholders: {birds}, {name}
msgid "{birds} birds of {name} singing at once"
msgstr "{name}的{birds}只鸟一起唱"

#. placeholders: {flocks}, {else}
msgid "{flocks} flocks flying {else}"
msgstr "{flocks}群鸟往{else}飞"

msgid "north"
