msgstr "在元宵节开放，新年的第十五天，{date_words}，{days_phrase}。"

#. placeholders: {zodiac}
msgid "Happy New Year: the Year of the {zodiac} parade is open."
msgstr "新年快乐：{zodiac}年游行开放了。"

msgid "The Lantern walk is open today."
msgstr "提灯游行今天开放。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Lanterns are up and lion-dance drums play along."
msgstr "灯笼挂起来了，舞狮的鼓声也一起响。"

#. placeholders: {days_phrase}
