#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {keepsake}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} parade: a long street that ends at midnight firecrackers, "
"and a keepsake for the year: {keepsake}."
msgstr "{sentence_start}游行：一条在午夜鞭炮声中结束的长街，还有当年的纪念品：{keepsake}。"

msgid ""
"It ends at midnight firecrackers, with a keepsake for the year's animal."
msgstr "它在午夜的鞭炮声中结束，还有当年生肖的纪念品。"

msgid ""
"A calm walk under the lanterns for the Lantern Festival: no firecrackers, "
"no gongs to miss, and lanterns to collect."
msgstr "元宵节在灯笼下平静地漫步：没有鞭炮，没有会错过的锣，还有灯笼可以收集。"

#. placeholders: {lantern_locked}
msgid "{lantern_locked} A calm walk, with lanterns to collect."
msgstr "{lantern_locked}平静地漫步，还有灯笼可以收集。"

msgid ""
"A short, slow street with every call spoken. Nothing is saved, and stumbles "
"cost nothing."
msgstr "一条又短又慢的街，每个口令都会说出来。什么都不保存，绊倒也不扣分。"

msgid ""
"Stars and best scores on every street, your longest dragon and the festival "
"days, with your challenge results."
msgstr "每条街的星星和最高分、你最长的龙和节日，以及你的挑战成绩。"

#. placeholders: {keepsakes}, {lanterns}, {LANTERNS}
msgid ""
"The keepsakes of the years' animals, {keepsakes} of 12, and the lanterns "
"you have found, {lanterns} of {LANTERNS}."
msgstr "历年生肖的纪念品，{keepsakes}个，共12个，以及你找到的灯笼，{lanterns}个，共{LANTERNS}个。"

msgid ""
"Spoken call-outs: on. The pearl, envelopes and firecrackers are named with "
"their lanes."
msgstr "语音播报：开。龙珠、红包和鞭炮都会连同它们的道一起说出来。"

msgid ""
"Spoken call-outs: off. You follow the pearl and dodge firecrackers without "
"call-outs."
msgstr "语音播报：关。你在没有播报的情况下追龙珠、躲鞭炮。"

msgid ""
"When on, a voice names the pearl's lane as it moves, and each envelope and "
"firecracker string as it comes."
msgstr "开启时，龙珠移动时会有声音说出它的道，每个红包和鞭炮串过来时也会说出来。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"A daily street, a weekly long parade and a monthly grand festival, the same "
"for every player."
msgstr "每天一条街，每周一场长游行，每月一场盛大庆典，所有玩家都一样。"

#. placeholders: {resets}
msgid ""
"A daily street, a weekly long parade and a monthly grand festival, the same "
"for every player. {resets}"
msgstr "每天一条街，每周一场长游行，每月一场盛大庆典，所有玩家都一样。{resets}"

msgid ""
"Keepsakes, none yet. Dance the New Year parade on Lunar New Year to earn "
"the year's animal keepsake, one for each of the twelve animals."
msgstr "纪念品，还没有。在农历新年跳新年游行，就能得到当年生肖的纪念品，十二生肖每个一件。"

#. placeholders: {n}
msgid "Keepsakes, {n} of 12."
msgstr "纪念品，{n}个，共12个。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Each Lunar New Year brings the next animal."
msgstr "每个农历新年都会带来下一个生肖。"

#. placeholders: {join}
msgid "Still to come: {join}. Each Lunar New Year brings the next animal."
msgstr "还没到的：{join}。每个农历新年都会带来下一个生肖。"

msgid ""
"Lanterns, none yet. The Lantern walk opens on the Lantern Festival, 14 days "
