msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a street, Enter dances it, Escape goes back. A street "
"opens when the one before has a star."
msgstr "Up和Down选择街道，Enter开始跳，Escape返回。前一条街得到星星后，下一条才会开放。"

#. placeholders: {base}
msgid "{base}, new"
msgstr "{base}，新"

#. placeholders: {n}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Earn a star on street {n} to open it."
msgstr "在第{n}条街得到一颗星就能开放它。"

#. placeholders: {n}, {sentence_start}
msgid "Earn a star on street {n} to open it. {sentence_start}."
msgstr "在第{n}条街得到一颗星就能开放它。{sentence_start}。"

#. placeholders: {best}
msgid "Best {best}."
msgstr "最高分{best}。"

msgid "Not danced yet."
msgstr "还没跳过。"

msgid "Return to the Dragon Dance title."
msgstr "回到Dragon Dance的标题菜单。"

msgid "Drum: a deep drum on every beat. The dragon dances on each one."
msgstr "鼓：每一拍一声低沉的鼓。龙在每一拍上起舞。"

msgid "First beat: the drum with a cymbal, on the first beat of each bar."
msgstr "第一拍：鼓声加镲，在每小节的第一拍。"

msgid "Count-in: wooden clicks before the street begins."
msgstr "数拍：街道开始前的木头咔嗒声。"

msgid "Drum roll: a gong strikes in 2 beats. Get ready to rear up."
msgstr "鼓点滚奏：2拍后锣响。准备腾起。"

msgid "Gong: rear up as it strikes."
msgstr "锣：锣响时腾起。"

msgid ""
"Midnight gong: the great gong at the end of the New Year parade, worth "
"double."
msgstr "午夜锣：新年游行最后的大锣，分值翻倍。"

msgid ""
"Perfect rear: a whoosh and a bright cymbal. You reared right on the gong."
msgstr "完美腾起：一声呼啸和明亮的镲声。你正好在锣响时腾起。"

msgid "Good rear: a whoosh. You reared close to the gong."
msgstr "不错的腾起：一声呼啸。你在锣响附近腾起。"

msgid "Missed gong: a dull wooden knock. The gong passed without a rear."
msgstr "错过锣声：一声沉闷的木头敲击。锣响过去了，你没有腾起。"

msgid ""
"Stray rear: a soft thud. You reared with no gong near, and the combo breaks."
msgstr "乱腾：一声轻轻的闷响。附近没有锣声你就腾起了，连击中断。"

msgid "Pearl: a soft shimmer ahead of you, in the pearl's lane. Follow it."
msgstr "龙珠：你前方一阵轻柔的微光声，在龙珠那条道上。跟着它。"

msgid "Pearl moves: a bright chime from the pearl's new lane."
msgstr "龙珠移动：从龙珠新的道上传来一声明亮的叮。"

msgid ""
"On the pearl: a soft high ping as your head reaches the pearl's lane."
msgstr "在龙珠上：龙头到达龙珠那条道时一声轻柔的高音叮。"

msgid ""
"Off the pearl: a falling tone. You were away from the pearl too long, and "
"the combo breaks."
msgstr "离开龙珠：一个下降的音。你离开龙珠太久，连击中断。"

msgid "Step: the head moves one lane."
msgstr "移动：龙头移动一条道。"

msgid "Street edge: a wooden bump. You are in the last lane on that side."
msgstr "街道边缘：一声木头碰撞。你在那一边的最后一条道上。"

msgid ""
"Red envelope coming: a papery rustle with little bells, coming down its "
"lane."
msgstr "红包过来：一阵纸张的沙沙声和小铃铛声，沿着它的道过来。"

msgid "Envelope caught: coins and a chime. The dragon grows one segment."
msgstr "接到红包：硬币声和一声叮。龙身长出一节。"

msgid "Envelope missed: a soft flutter as it drifts past."
msgstr "错过红包：它飘过时一阵轻柔的扑簌声。"

msgid ""
"Firecrackers coming: a fizzing crackle in their lane. Keep your head out of "
"it."
msgstr "鞭炮过来：它们那条道上的嘶嘶噼啪声。龙头不要在那条道上。"

msgid "Firecrackers burst: a crackle in another lane. You are safe."
msgstr "鞭炮炸响：另一条道上的噼啪声。你很安全。"

msgid ""
"Stumble: firecrackers right under you and a clatter. The tail stumbles and "
"you lose points."
msgstr "绊倒：鞭炮就在你脚下，一阵乒乓声。龙尾绊倒，你会失去分数。"

msgid "Lantern coming: a warm, low glow of chimes, on the Lantern walk."
msgstr "灯笼过来：一串温暖低沉的叮声，在提灯游行中出现。"

msgid "Lantern caught: a soft harp run."
msgstr "接到灯笼：一串轻柔的竖琴音。"

msgid "Crowd cheers: a shop's crowd cheers as you dance past."
msgstr "人群欢呼：你跳着经过时，店铺的人群欢呼起来。"

msgid ""
"Polite clapping: a shop's crowd claps. Keep a combo going and they cheer."
msgstr "礼貌的掌声：店铺的人群鼓掌。保持连击，他们就会欢呼。"

msgid ""
"Combo cheer: a big cheer and a cymbal for every 16 beats on the pearl."
msgstr "连击欢呼：在龙珠上每满16拍，就有一阵热烈的欢呼和镲声。"

msgid "Countdown: a ticking wood block, the beats before midnight."
msgstr "倒数：木鱼的滴答声，午夜前的那几拍。"

msgid "Dull tap: nothing to do there."
msgstr "沉闷轻敲：那里没有可做的事。"

