#. placeholders: {FLASHES}, {p}, {ROUNDS}
msgid ""
"Midsummer night. A bonfire burns in the middle of the meadow, and the "
"fireflies gather round it. They flash together, {FLASHES} flashes in a row, "
"then rest. Some drift out of step and flash a moment late. Press {p} with "
"each flash to bring a straggler back into the chorus. The show lasts "
"{ROUNDS} rounds."
msgstr ""
"仲夏之夜。草地中间燃着一堆篝火，萤火虫围着它聚集。它们一起闪，连闪{FLASHES}下，然后停一下。有些会跟不上节奏，晚一点才闪。每次闪光时按{p}，把"
"一只掉队的拉回合唱。表演持续{ROUNDS}轮。"

