msgid "Dipper"
msgstr "单闪萤"

msgid "Twin Spark"
msgstr "双星萤"

msgid "Slow Ember"
msgstr "慢烬萤"

msgid "Triple Twinkle"
msgstr "三闪萤"

msgid "Orchard Lantern"
msgstr "果园灯萤"

msgid "Creek Glimmer"
msgstr "溪光萤"

msgid "Hay Flicker"
msgstr "草闪萤"

msgid "Blue Ghost"
msgstr "蓝幽灵"

msgid "Late Ember"
msgstr "晚烬萤"

msgid "Midsummer Chorus"
msgstr "仲夏合唱萤"

msgid "one long flash, low and golden"
msgstr "一下长长的闪光，低沉而金黄"

msgid "two quick flashes"
msgstr "两下快速的闪光"

msgid "one slow, deep glow"
msgstr "一下缓慢深沉的光"

msgid "three quick, high flashes"
msgstr "三下快速的高处闪光"

msgid "one bright flash with a long dark wait"
msgstr "一下明亮的闪光，然后长长地暗着等待"

msgid "two flashes with a pause between"
msgstr "两下闪光，中间停一下"

msgid "one tiny, quick flash, often"
msgstr "一下又小又快的闪光，常常闪"

msgid "a steady glow that lasts for seconds"
msgstr "一道持续好几秒的稳定的光"

msgid "one low, slow flash, far apart"
msgstr "一下低沉缓慢的闪光，间隔很长"

msgid "six flashes in a row, all together"
msgstr "连着六下闪光，全都一起"

msgid ""
"The most common firefly. Its flash swoops upward as it flies, like a letter "
"J drawn in light."
msgstr "最常见的萤火虫。它边飞边闪，光往上一挑，像用光画出的字母J。"

msgid ""
"Small and busy, it flashes twice and moves on. Often the first out in "
"spring."
msgstr "又小又忙，闪两下就走。常常是春天最早出来的。"

msgid "A big, unhurried firefly that glows low in the grass like a coal."
msgstr "一只又大又不慌不忙的萤火虫，在草丛低处像一块炭那样发光。"

msgid "It rises as it blinks, three sparks in a row, high above the grass."
msgstr "它边闪边往上升，连着三点火花，高高在草地上方。"

msgid "It hangs in the apple trees and lights up seldom, but brightly."
msgstr "它挂在苹果树上，很少亮，但亮起来很明亮。"

msgid "A green glimmer that follows the water, flash, pause, flash."
msgstr "一道跟着水流的绿色微光，闪，停，闪。"

msgid ""
"A tiny firefly of the hayfield that flickers fast. Quick hands catch it."
msgstr "干草地里一只闪得很快的小萤火虫。手快才能抓到。"

msgid ""
"Rare and quiet. It glows a soft blue near the ground and drifts like a "
"ghost."
msgstr "稀少又安静。它在贴近地面的地方发出柔和的蓝光，像幽灵一样飘着。"

msgid ""
"The last firefly of the year, out on cool autumn evenings when the others "
"are gone."
msgstr "一年中最后一只萤火虫，在凉爽的秋天傍晚、其他萤火虫都走了的时候出来。"

msgid ""
"On midsummer night thousands of them flash together, the whole meadow in "
"one breath."
msgstr "仲夏之夜，成千上万只一起闪，整片草地就像在同一次呼吸。"

msgid "Found in every meadow, spring and summer."
msgstr "春夏两季，每片草地都有。"

msgid ""
"In spring, every meadow; in summer, the home meadow and the creek bank."
msgstr "春天每片草地都有；夏天在家门口的草地和小溪岸边。"

msgid ""
"In summer, the home meadow and the hayfield; in early autumn, every meadow."
msgstr "夏天在家门口的草地和干草地；初秋每片草地都有。"

msgid "Found in the orchard and the hayfield, in summer."
msgstr "夏天在果园和干草地里能找到。"

msgid "Found only in the orchard, in summer."
msgstr "只在夏天的果园里能找到。"

msgid "Found only on the creek bank, in summer."
msgstr "只在夏天的小溪岸边能找到。"

msgid "Found only in the hayfield, in summer."
msgstr "只在夏天的干草地里能找到。"

msgid "Rare: found in the orchard and on the creek bank, in summer."
msgstr "稀有：夏天在果园和小溪岸边能找到。"

msgid "Found only in autumn."
msgstr "只在秋天能找到。"

msgid "Found only on midsummer night."
msgstr "只在仲夏之夜能找到。"

msgid "the Open Fifth"
msgstr "空五度"

msgid "the Summer Triad"
msgstr "夏日三和弦"

msgid "the Dusk Chord"
msgstr "黄昏和弦"

msgid "the Creek Chord"
msgstr "小溪和弦"

msgid "the Porch Song"
msgstr "门廊之歌"

msgid "the Whole Meadow"
msgstr "整片草地"

msgid "Notes C and G, and nothing else."
msgstr "音符C和G，没有别的。"

msgid "Notes C, E and G."
msgstr "音符C、E和G。"

msgid "Notes C, E and A."
msgstr "音符C、E和A。"

msgid "Notes D, G and A."
msgstr "音符D、G和A。"

msgid "Notes C, E, G and A."
msgstr "音符C、E、G和A。"

msgid "All five notes, C, D, E, G and A."
msgstr "全部五个音：C、D、E、G和A。"

#. placeholders: {join}, {last}
msgid "{join} and {last}"
msgstr "{join}和{last}"

msgid "Stay out a little longer: the lesson ends in the meadow."
msgstr "再多待一会儿：教程在草地上结束。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "A firefly drifts in the meadow."
msgstr "一只萤火虫在草地上飘着。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Walk until it is in reach."
msgstr "走到够得着它的地方。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {d}, {l}, {r}, {u}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{sentence_start}, {d}, {l} and {r} walk one step at a time, and {u} is "
"always north."
msgstr "{sentence_start}、{d}、{l}和{r}一次走一步，{u}永远是北。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {d}, {l}, {r}, {u}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start}, {d}, {l} and {r} walk one step at a time, and {u} is "
"always north. A firefly drifts in the meadow. Walk until it is in reach."
msgstr "{sentence_start}、{d}、{l}和{r}一次走一步，{u}永远是北。一只萤火虫在草地上飘着。走到够得着它的地方。"

msgid "In reach."
msgstr "够得着了。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Press as it lights up."
msgstr "在它亮起时按下。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} catches a firefly in reach, but only while it glows."
msgstr "{sentence_start}能抓住够得着的萤火虫，但只能在它发光时。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} catches a firefly in reach, but only while it glows. Press "
"as it lights up."
msgstr "{sentence_start}能抓住够得着的萤火虫，但只能在它发光时。在它亮起时按下。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Set them free now."
msgstr "现在放它们走吧。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Their notes ring together as a chord."
msgstr "它们的音符一齐响起，成了一个和弦。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} releases the fireflies from your jar."
msgstr "{sentence_start}把罐子里的萤火虫放出来。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} releases the fireflies from your jar. Their notes ring "
"together as a chord. Set them free now."
msgstr "{sentence_start}把罐子里的萤火虫放出来。它们的音符一齐响起，成了一个和弦。现在放它们走吧。"

msgid ""
"It is dusk, nothing here can go wrong, and you catch fireflies in a jar. "
"Learn on the practice patch"
msgstr "天色已晚，这里什么都不会出错，你用罐子抓萤火虫。在练习草地上学一学"

msgid ""
"Some species flash two or three times: press once for every flash. Your jar "
"holds 6, and chords with names go in your journal. Play walks the home "
"meadow."
msgstr "有些种类会闪两三下：每闪一下就按一次。你的罐子能装6只，有名字的和弦会记进你的日志。选开始会走进家门口的草地。"

msgid ""
"Patience by a cabin fire: move all 52 cards onto four suit foundations, ace "
"to king. Every relaxed deal can be won. Undo is unlimited. There is no "
"clock and no move limit, and you cannot lose."
msgstr ""
"小屋炉火旁的接龙：把全部52张牌移到四个花色的收牌堆上，从A到K。每一局轻松牌都能赢。撤销次数不限。没有时钟，没有步数限制，你也不会输。"

msgid ""
"Patience by a cabin fire: move all 52 cards onto four suit foundations, ace "
"to king."
msgstr "小屋炉火旁的接龙：把全部52张牌移到四个花色的收牌堆上，从A到K。"

msgid "Every relaxed deal can be won."
msgstr "每一局轻松牌都能赢。"

msgid "Undo is unlimited."
msgstr "撤销次数不限。"

msgid "There is no clock and no move limit, and you cannot lose."
msgstr "没有时钟，没有步数限制，你也不会输。"

msgid "The row of places"
msgstr "一排位置"

msgid ""
"The table has a row of 12 places: piles 1 to 7, then the stock, then the "
"foundations for hearts, diamonds, clubs and spades. Left and Right move. "
"The game names each place's top card. You cannot move beyond either end of "
"the row."
msgstr ""
"牌桌上有一排12个位置：第1到第7列，然后是牌库，再是红桃、方块、梅花和黑桃的收牌堆。Left和Right移动。游戏会报出每个位置最上面的牌。你不能移出"
"这一排的两端。"

msgid ""
"The table has a row of 12 places: piles 1 to 7, then the stock, then the "
"foundations for hearts, diamonds, clubs and spades."
msgstr "牌桌上有一排12个位置：第1到第7列，然后是牌库，再是红桃、方块、梅花和黑桃的收牌堆。"

msgid "Left and Right move."
msgstr "Left和Right移动。"

msgid "The game names each place's top card."
msgstr "游戏会报出每个位置最上面的牌。"

msgid "You cannot move beyond either end of the row."
msgstr "你不能移出这一排的两端。"

msgid "Piles"
msgstr "牌列"

msgid ""
"Each pile starts with face-down cards and one face-up card on top. A pile "
"builds down in alternating colours: a black 7 goes on a red 8, and a red "
"queen on a black king. Only a king goes on an empty pile. When a pile's "
"last face-up card leaves, the card under it turns face up, and you hear its "
"name. Up moves one card deeper into the face-up run. Down moves back toward "
"the top card."
msgstr ""
"每一列开始时有几张背面朝上的牌，最上面一张正面朝上。牌列按红黑交替往下接：黑7接在红8上，红Q接在黑K上。只有K能放到空列上。一列的最后一张正面牌移走后"
"，下面那张会翻开，你会听到它的名字。Up往正面朝上的牌里深入一张。Down退回最上面的牌。"

msgid "Each pile starts with face-down cards and one face-up card on top."
msgstr "每一列开始时有几张背面朝上的牌，最上面一张正面朝上。"

msgid ""
"A pile builds down in alternating colours: a black 7 goes on a red 8, and a "
"red queen on a black king."
msgstr "牌列按红黑交替往下接：黑7接在红8上，红Q接在黑K上。"

msgid "Only a king goes on an empty pile."
msgstr "只有K能放到空列上。"

msgid ""
"When a pile's last face-up card leaves, the card under it turns face up, "
"and you hear its name."
msgstr "一列的最后一张正面牌移走后，下面那张会翻开，你会听到它的名字。"

msgid "Up moves one card deeper into the face-up run."
msgstr "Up往正面朝上的牌里深入一张。"

msgid "Down moves back toward the top card."
msgstr "Down退回最上面的牌。"

msgid "Moving cards"
msgstr "移动牌"

msgid ""
"Space picks up the card under you, with every card on top of it. Move to "
"where the cards go, and Space again places them. If the cards cannot go "
"there, the game explains the rule, such as \"The 9 of spades cannot go on "
"the 9 of hearts. It needs a red 10.\" You keep holding the cards, so you can "
"try another place. While you hold cards, \"Fits here.\" marks each place they "
"fit. If you hold one card on the wrong foundation, the game names its "
"foundation, such as \"Goes to spades.\" Space on the place they came from "
"puts them back."
msgstr ""
"Space拿起你所在位置的牌，连同压在它上面的所有牌。移到要放的地方，再按Space放下。如果牌不能放在那里，游戏会解释规则，比如“黑桃9不能放在红桃9"
"上。它需要一张红10。”你仍然拿着牌，可以试试别的地方。拿着牌时，每个放得下的位置都会提示“放得下。”如果你拿着一张牌停在不对的收牌堆上，游戏会报出它该"
"去的收牌堆，比如“去黑桃。”在牌原来的位置按Space会把它们放回去。"

msgid "Space picks up the card under you, with every card on top of it."
msgstr "Space拿起你所在位置的牌，连同压在它上面的所有牌。"

msgid "Move to where the cards go, and Space again places them."
msgstr "移到要放的地方，再按Space放下。"

msgid ""
"If the cards cannot go there, the game explains the rule, such as \"The 9 of "
"spades cannot go on the 9 of hearts."
msgstr "如果牌不能放在那里，游戏会解释规则，比如“黑桃9不能放在红桃9上。"

msgid ""
"It needs a red 10.\" You keep holding the cards, so you can try another "
"place."
msgstr "它需要一张红10。”你仍然拿着牌，可以试试别的地方。"

msgid "While you hold cards, \"Fits here.\" marks each place they fit."
msgstr "拿着牌时，每个放得下的位置都会提示“放得下。”"

msgid ""
"If you hold one card on the wrong foundation, the game names its "
"foundation, such as \"Goes to spades.\" Space on the place they came from "
"puts them back."
msgstr "如果你拿着一张牌停在不对的收牌堆上，游戏会报出它该去的收牌堆，比如“去黑桃。”在牌原来的位置按Space会把它们放回去。"

msgid "The stock"
msgstr "牌库"

msgid ""
"Tab turns one card up from the stock. Space picks up the turned-up card at "
"the stock's place. When the stock runs out, Tab turns the turned-up cards "
"back over to use again, as often as you like. Tab while you hold cards puts "
"them back first. In draw three, Tab turns 3 cards at a time, and only the "
"top one can be played."
msgstr ""
"Tab从牌库翻开一张牌。在牌库的位置按Space拿起翻开的牌。牌库用完后，Tab会把翻开的牌翻回去重新用，想用几次都行。拿着牌时按Tab，会先把牌放回去"
"。翻三张模式下，Tab一次翻3张，只有最上面那张能出。"

msgid "Tab turns one card up from the stock."
msgstr "Tab从牌库翻开一张牌。"

msgid "Space picks up the turned-up card at the stock's place."
msgstr "在牌库的位置按Space拿起翻开的牌。"

msgid ""
"When the stock runs out, Tab turns the turned-up cards back over to use "
"again, as often as you like."
msgstr "牌库用完后，Tab会把翻开的牌翻回去重新用，想用几次都行。"

msgid "Tab while you hold cards puts them back first."
msgstr "拿着牌时按Tab，会先把牌放回去。"

msgid ""
"In draw three, Tab turns 3 cards at a time, and only the top one can be "
"played."
msgstr "翻三张模式下，Tab一次翻3张，只有最上面那张能出。"

msgid "Foundations"
msgstr "收牌堆"

msgid ""
"Each suit has its own foundation, built up one card at a time from the ace "
"to the king. Space on any foundation sends a single card to its own suit. "
"Once every card is face up and the stock is used, the rest go up on their "
"own."
msgstr ""
"每个花色有自己的收牌堆，从A到K一张一张往上叠。在任何收牌堆上按Space，都会把一张牌送到它自己花色的收牌堆。所有牌都翻开、牌库也用完后，剩下的牌会自"
"己收上去。"

msgid ""
"Each suit has its own foundation, built up one card at a time from the ace "
"to the king."
msgstr "每个花色有自己的收牌堆，从A到K一张一张往上叠。"

msgid "Space on any foundation sends a single card to its own suit."
msgstr "在任何收牌堆上按Space，都会把一张牌送到它自己花色的收牌堆。"

msgid ""
"Once every card is face up and the stock is used, the rest go up on their "
"own."
msgstr "所有牌都翻开、牌库也用完后，剩下的牌会自己收上去。"

msgid "Undo and getting stuck"
msgstr "撤销和卡住"

msgid ""
"Backspace takes back your last move, as many times as you like, face-down "
"cards and all. Backspace puts cards back while you hold them. If no move is "
"left that helps, the game says so. Every relaxed deal can be won from the "
"start, so undo far enough and a way through is always there. For a fresh "
"deal, press Escape, then Back to the title, then Play."
msgstr ""
"Backspace撤回你的上一步，想撤几次都行，连背面朝上的牌也会恢复。拿着牌时按Backspace会把牌放回去。如果已经没有有用的走法，游戏会告诉你。"
"每一局轻松牌从一开始就能赢，所以撤得够远，总有出路。想换一局新牌，按Escape，再选回到标题菜单，然后选开始。"

msgid ""
"Backspace takes back your last move, as many times as you like, face-down "
"cards and all."
msgstr "Backspace撤回你的上一步，想撤几次都行，连背面朝上的牌也会恢复。"

msgid "Backspace puts cards back while you hold them."
msgstr "拿着牌时按Backspace会把牌放回去。"

msgid "If no move is left that helps, the game says so."
msgstr "如果已经没有有用的走法，游戏会告诉你。"

msgid ""
"Every relaxed deal can be won from the start, so undo far enough and a way "
"through is always there."
msgstr "每一局轻松牌从一开始就能赢，所以撤得够远，总有出路。"

msgid "For a fresh deal, press Escape, then Back to the title, then Play."
msgstr "想换一局新牌，按Escape，再选回到标题菜单，然后选开始。"

msgid ""
"H names the next move, such as \"The 4 of clubs in pile 2 can go on the 5 of "
"hearts in pile 6.\" It follows a line that wins the deal from where you are, "
"when it can find one, so taking every hint never leads into a dead end. "
"When the suggested card is deeper in the stock, the hint says to turn it. "
"Hints cost nothing."
msgstr ""
"H会说出下一步，比如“第2列的梅花4可以放到第6列的红桃5上。”只要找得到，它会沿着从当前局面赢下这局的路线提示，所以每次都听提示也不会走进死路。如果建"
"议的牌在牌库深处，提示会让你去翻牌。提示不扣任何东西。"

msgid ""
"H names the next move, such as \"The 4 of clubs in pile 2 can go on the 5 of "
"hearts in pile 6.\" It follows a line that wins the deal from where you are, "
"when it can find one, so taking every hint never leads into a dead end."
msgstr ""
"H会说出下一步，比如“第2列的梅花4可以放到第6列的红桃5上。”只要找得到，它会沿着从当前局面赢下这局的路线提示，所以每次都听提示也不会走进死路。"

msgid ""
"When the suggested card is deeper in the stock, the hint says to turn it."
msgstr "如果建议的牌在牌库深处，提示会让你去翻牌。"

msgid "Hints cost nothing."
msgstr "提示不扣任何东西。"

msgid "Status and the table"
msgstr "状态和牌桌"

msgid ""
"S gives the cards you hold and where you are. Press S again straight away "
"for the cards on the foundations, the cards left to turn in the stock, the "
"face-down cards and your moves, always in that order. R reads the whole "
"table: the top card of each pile, the stock and the four foundations."
msgstr ""
"S会说出你拿着的牌和你所在的位置。紧接着再按一次S，会依次说出收牌堆上的牌数、牌库里还没翻的牌、背面朝上的牌和你的步数，顺序总是这样。R会读出整张牌桌："
"每一列最上面的牌、牌库和四个收牌堆。"

msgid "S gives the cards you hold and where you are."
msgstr "S会说出你拿着的牌和你所在的位置。"

msgid ""
"Press S again straight away for the cards on the foundations, the cards "
"left to turn in the stock, the face-down cards and your moves, always in "
"that order."
msgstr "紧接着再按一次S，会依次说出收牌堆上的牌数、牌库里还没翻的牌、背面朝上的牌和你的步数，顺序总是这样。"

msgid ""
"R reads the whole table: the top card of each pile, the stock and the four "
"foundations."
msgstr "R会读出整张牌桌：每一列最上面的牌、牌库和四个收牌堆。"

msgid ""
"A move is any card move or any turn of the stock. Undo takes a move back, "
"so it does not count. A won deal scores 1000 points, less 1 for every move. "
"Records keep the relaxed deals you have won, your fewest moves and your "
"best score."
msgstr ""
"一步是指任何一次移牌或翻牌库。撤销会收回一步，所以不算步数。赢下一局得1000分，每走一步减1分。纪录里保存你赢过的轻松局数、最少步数和最高分。"

msgid "A move is any card move or any turn of the stock."
msgstr "一步是指任何一次移牌或翻牌库。"

msgid "Undo takes a move back, so it does not count."
msgstr "撤销会收回一步，所以不算步数。"

msgid "A won deal scores 1000 points, less 1 for every move."
msgstr "赢下一局得1000分，每走一步减1分。"

msgid ""
"Records keep the relaxed deals you have won, your fewest moves and your "
"best score."
msgstr "纪录里保存你赢过的轻松局数、最少步数和最高分。"

msgid ""
"Every player gets the same cards, and every challenge deal can be won. The "
"daily, Tonight's deal, is one draw one deal, new each day. The weekly, Draw "
"three week, is one draw three deal, new each Monday. The monthly, Five by "
"the fire, is five draw one deals in a row, with the scores added. Your "
"result counts when the last card goes up. Leave the challenge, on the pause "
"menu, does not count, so you can try again later."
msgstr ""
"每位玩家拿到的牌都一样，每一局挑战牌都能赢。每日挑战“今晚的牌局”是一局翻一张，每天更新。每周挑战“翻三张周”是一局翻三张，每周一更新。每月挑战“炉边五"
"局”是连着五局翻一张，得分相加。最后一张牌收上去时，你的成绩才算数。在暂停菜单里选离开挑战不算成绩，你可以以后再试。"

msgid ""
"Every player gets the same cards, and every challenge deal can be won."
msgstr "每位玩家拿到的牌都一样，每一局挑战牌都能赢。"

msgid "The daily, Tonight's deal, is one draw one deal, new each day."
msgstr "每日挑战“今晚的牌局”是一局翻一张，每天更新。"

msgid ""
"The weekly, Draw three week, is one draw three deal, new each Monday."
msgstr "每周挑战“翻三张周”是一局翻三张，每周一更新。"

msgid ""
"The monthly, Five by the fire, is five draw one deals in a row, with the "
"scores added."
msgstr "每月挑战“炉边五局”是连着五局翻一张，得分相加。"

msgid "Your result counts when the last card goes up."
msgstr "最后一张牌收上去时，你的成绩才算数。"

msgid "Calendar events"
msgstr "日历活动"

msgid ""
"Rabbit rabbit deal: on the 1st of every month, when an old charm says "
"\"rabbit rabbit\" for a lucky month, the Rabbit rabbit deal row on the title "
"opens. On other days it stays in its place, locked, and says when it opens. "
"It is one deal for every player that day, and it can always be won. Turning "
"the stock costs no moves, so the score counts only the cards you move, and "
"S says \"turns are free\". It is scored on a board of its own. Once the day "
"is over, Play again on the results says the Rabbit rabbit deal has ended "
"and takes you back to the title."
msgstr ""
"兔子兔子牌局：每个月1号，按老话说一声“兔子兔子”就能交好运一整月，这天标题菜单上的兔子兔子牌局一行会开放。其他日子它留在原处，锁着，并告诉你什么时候开"
"放。这一天所有玩家打同一局牌，而且总能赢。翻牌库不算步数，所以得分只算你移动的牌，S会说“翻牌不计步”。它有自己单独的排行榜。这一天过去后，在结算里选再"
"来一局，会告诉你兔子兔子牌局已经结束，并带你回到标题菜单。"

msgid ""
"Rabbit rabbit deal: on the 1st of every month, when an old charm says "
"\"rabbit rabbit\" for a lucky month, the Rabbit rabbit deal row on the title "
"opens."
msgstr "兔子兔子牌局：每个月1号，按老话说一声“兔子兔子”就能交好运一整月，这天标题菜单上的兔子兔子牌局一行会开放。"

msgid "On other days it stays in its place, locked, and says when it opens."
msgstr "其他日子它留在原处，锁着，并告诉你什么时候开放。"

msgid "It is one deal for every player that day, and it can always be won."
msgstr "这一天所有玩家打同一局牌，而且总能赢。"

msgid ""
"Turning the stock costs no moves, so the score counts only the cards you "
"move, and S says \"turns are free\"."
msgstr "翻牌库不算步数，所以得分只算你移动的牌，S会说“翻牌不计步”。"

msgid "It is scored on a board of its own."
msgstr "它有自己单独的排行榜。"

msgid ""
"Once the day is over, Play again on the results says the Rabbit rabbit deal "
"has ended and takes you back to the title."
msgstr "这一天过去后，在结算里选再来一局，会告诉你兔子兔子牌局已经结束，并带你回到标题菜单。"

msgid "Left and Right: move along the piles, the stock and the foundations."
msgstr "Left和Right：在牌列、牌库和收牌堆之间移动。"

msgid ""
"Up and Down: move deeper into a pile's face-up cards, and back toward the "
"top card."
msgstr "Up和Down：深入一列正面朝上的牌，或退回最上面的牌。"

msgid "Space: pick up the cards under you, or place the cards you hold."
msgstr "Space：拿起你所在位置的牌，或放下你拿着的牌。"

msgid "Tab: turn the stock."
msgstr "Tab：翻牌库。"

msgid ""
"Backspace: take back the last move, or put back the cards you hold. This "
"key belongs to Fireside Patience and cannot be changed in Settings."
msgstr "Backspace：撤回上一步，或放回你拿着的牌。这个键属于Fireside Patience，不能在设置里更改。"

msgid "Backspace: take back the last move, or put back the cards you hold."
msgstr "Backspace：撤回上一步，或放回你拿着的牌。"

msgid ""
"This key belongs to Fireside Patience and cannot be changed in Settings."
msgstr "这个键属于Fireside Patience，不能在设置里更改。"

msgid ""
"Home and End: jump to the first pile, or to the last foundation. These keys "
"belong to Fireside Patience too."
msgstr "Home和End：跳到第一列，或跳到最后一个收牌堆。这两个键也属于Fireside Patience。"

msgid "Home and End: jump to the first pile, or to the last foundation."
msgstr "Home和End：跳到第一列，或跳到最后一个收牌堆。"

msgid "These keys belong to Fireside Patience too."
msgstr "这两个键也属于Fireside Patience。"

msgid ""
"S: what you hold and where you are. Press it twice for the rest of the "
"table's count."
msgstr "S：你拿着什么、你在哪里。按两次会说出牌桌上其余的计数。"

msgid "S: what you hold and where you are."
msgstr "S：你拿着什么、你在哪里。"

msgid "Press it twice for the rest of the table's count."
msgstr "按两次会说出牌桌上其余的计数。"

msgid "R: read the whole table."
msgstr "R：读出整张牌桌。"

msgid "H: a useful move."
msgstr "H：一步有用的走法。"

msgid "Tonight's deal"
msgstr "今晚的牌局"

msgid "Draw three week"
msgstr "翻三张周"

msgid "Five by the fire"
msgstr "炉边五局"

msgid "one deal, fewest moves"
msgstr "一局，步数最少"

msgid "one draw three deal, fewest moves"
msgstr "一局翻三张，步数最少"

#. placeholders: {MONTHLY_DEALS}
msgid "{MONTHLY_DEALS} deals, fewest moves in all"
msgstr "{MONTHLY_DEALS}局，总步数最少"

#. placeholders: {POINTS}
msgid "Each won deal scores {POINTS} points, less 1 for every move."
msgstr "每赢一局得{POINTS}分，每走一步减1分。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "One draw one deal that can always be won."
msgstr "一局翻一张，总能赢。"

