msgid "One draw one deal that can always be won. {score}"
msgstr "一局翻一张，总能赢。{score}"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "It can always be won."
msgstr "总能赢。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"One draw three deal: the stock turns 3 cards at a time, and only the top "
"one plays."
msgstr "一局翻三张：牌库一次翻3张，只有最上面那张能出。"

#. placeholders: {score}
msgid ""
"One draw three deal: the stock turns 3 cards at a time, and only the top "
"one plays. It can always be won. {score}"
msgstr "一局翻三张：牌库一次翻3张，只有最上面那张能出。总能赢。{score}"

#. placeholders: {MONTHLY_DEALS}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{MONTHLY_DEALS} draw one deals in a row, each one winnable."
msgstr "连着{MONTHLY_DEALS}局翻一张，每局都能赢。"

#. placeholders: {MONTHLY_DEALS}, {score}
msgid ""
"{MONTHLY_DEALS} draw one deals in a row, each one winnable. {score} Your "
"total is the sum of the {MONTHLY_DEALS} deal scores."
msgstr "连着{MONTHLY_DEALS}局翻一张，每局都能赢。{score}你的总分是这{MONTHLY_DEALS}局得分之和。"

#. placeholders: {score}, {MONTHLY_DEALS}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{score} Your total is the sum of the {MONTHLY_DEALS} deal scores."
msgstr "{score}你的总分是这{MONTHLY_DEALS}局得分之和。"

msgid "Fireside Patience"
msgstr "Fireside Patience"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a challenge, Enter reads its briefing, Escape goes back. "
"Every player gets the same cards: a new deal each day, a draw three deal "
"each Monday and five deals each month."
msgstr "Up和Down选择挑战，Enter读出简报，Escape返回。每位玩家拿到的牌都一样：每天一局新牌，每周一一局翻三张，每月五局。"

msgid "Opening the Fireside Patience challenge."
msgstr "正在打开Fireside Patience挑战。"

#. placeholders: {deals}, {moves_words}
msgid "All {deals} deals won, in {moves_words} in all."
msgstr "{deals}局全部赢下，共{moves_words}。"

#. placeholders: {moves_words}
msgid "Deal won in {moves_words}."
msgstr "赢下一局，用了{moves_words}。"

#. placeholders: {index}, {deals}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Deal {index} of {deals}."
msgstr "第{index}局，共{deals}局。"

#. placeholders: {index}, {deals}, {moves_words}
msgid "Deal {index} of {deals}. {moves_words} so far."
msgstr "第{index}局，共{deals}局。目前{moves_words}。"

#. placeholders: {moves_words}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{moves_words} so far."
msgstr "目前{moves_words}。"

msgid "Rabbit rabbit deal"
msgstr "兔子兔子牌局"

msgid "Rabbit rabbit"
msgstr "兔子兔子"

#. placeholders: {next_words}
msgid "The Rabbit rabbit deal opens {next_words}."
msgstr "兔子兔子牌局{next_words}开放。"

#. placeholders: {every}, {next_words}
msgid ""
"Opens {every}, {next_words}: one lucky deal for everyone, where turning the "
"stock costs no moves."
msgstr "{every}开放，{next_words}：所有人同一局好运牌，翻牌库不算步数。"

msgid ""
"Rabbit rabbit, a lucky month: one deal for everyone, and turning the stock "
"costs no moves."
msgstr "兔子兔子，好运一整月：所有人同一局牌，翻牌库不算步数。"

msgid "The 1st of the month is over, so the Rabbit rabbit deal has ended."
msgstr "本月1号已经过去，兔子兔子牌局结束了。"

#. placeholders: {best}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Open all day.{best}"
msgstr "全天开放。{best}"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Rabbit rabbit, for a lucky month: one deal for everyone today, and it can "
"always be won."
msgstr "兔子兔子，好运一整月：今天所有人同一局牌，而且总能赢。"

#. placeholders: {best}
msgid ""
"Rabbit rabbit, for a lucky month: one deal for everyone today, and it can "
"always be won. Turning the stock costs no moves. Scored on a board of its "
"own. Open all day.{best}"
msgstr "兔子兔子，好运一整月：今天所有人同一局牌，而且总能赢。翻牌库不算步数。有自己单独的排行榜。全天开放。{best}"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Scored on a board of its own."
msgstr "有自己单独的排行榜。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Turning the stock costs no moves."
msgstr "翻牌库不算步数。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
msgid "{sentence_start} foundation"
msgstr "{sentence_start}收牌堆"

#. placeholders: {p}
msgid "Pile {p}"
msgstr "第{p}列"

msgid "Stock"
msgstr "牌库"

msgid "none left to turn"
msgstr "没有可翻的牌了"

#. placeholders: {cards_words}
msgid "{cards_words} to turn"
