msgstr "松开就滑行。"

#. placeholders: {per_hour}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Pedal up to {per_hour}, then coast for 2 seconds."
msgstr "蹬到{per_hour}，然后滑行2秒。"

#. placeholders: {down}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Hold {down} to brake."
msgstr "按住{down}刹车。"

#. placeholders: {LESSONS}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Lesson 2 of {LESSONS}: brake."
msgstr "第2课，共{LESSONS}课：刹车。"

#. placeholders: {LESSONS}, {down}, {per_hour}
msgid ""
"Lesson 2 of {LESSONS}: brake. Hold {down} to brake. The brakes build over a "
"moment, so start early. Pedal up to {per_hour}, then brake to a stop."
msgstr ""
"第2课，共{LESSONS}课：刹车。按住{down}刹车。刹车要一会儿才会起效，所以早点开始。蹬到{per_hour}，然后刹车停下。"

#. placeholders: {per_hour}
#. one sentence of a longer line
