msgstr "蹬到{per_hour}，然后刹车停下。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The brakes build over a moment, so start early."
msgstr "刹车要一会儿才会起效，所以早点开始。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "A line divides the bike lane from the traffic lane."
msgstr "一条线把自行车道和行车道分开。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Get moving, steer out into the traffic lane, then back into the bike lane."
msgstr "骑起来，转出到行车道，再转回自行车道。"

#. placeholders: {LESSONS}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Lesson 3 of {LESSONS}: steer."
msgstr "第3课，共{LESSONS}课：转向。"

#. placeholders: {LESSONS}, {sentence_start}, {right}
msgid ""
"Lesson 3 of {LESSONS}: steer. {sentence_start} and {right} slide you across "
"the road while you hold them. A line divides the bike lane from the traffic "
"lane. Get moving, steer out into the traffic lane, then back into the bike "
"lane."
msgstr ""
"第3课，共{LESSONS}课：转向。按住{sentence_start}和{right}会让你横穿马路。一条线把自行车道和行车道分开。骑起来，转出到行"
"车道，再转回自行车道。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {right}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} and {right} slide you across the road while you hold them."
msgstr "按住{sentence_start}和{right}会让你横穿马路。"

#. placeholders: {LESSONS}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Lesson 4 of {LESSONS}: the door zone."
