msgid "Night select"
msgstr "选夜"

msgid "Dance any night you have opened, with the stars on each."
msgstr "跳任何已开启的夜晚，附带每夜的星星。"

msgid ""
"Any song you have opened. The music holds for each monster until you dance "
"its move."
msgstr "任何已开启的歌。每个怪物出现时音乐都会停住，直到你跳出它的动作。"

msgid ""
"Your stars, your best score on each night, your moves danced, and your "
"challenge results."
msgstr "你的星星、每夜的最高分、跳过的动作，还有你的挑战成绩。"

msgid "Spoken call-outs: on. Each monster is also named."
msgstr "语音播报：开。每个怪物也会被报出。"

msgid "Spoken call-outs: off. The monsters are not named."
msgstr "语音播报：关。不会报出怪物。"

msgid "When on, the game also names each monster as it comes up."
msgstr "打开后，每个怪物出现时游戏也会报出它。"

msgid ""
"Every monster, move and cue in the game, with its name and the key that "
"dances it."
msgstr "游戏里的每个怪物、动作和提示音，附带名字和跳它的键。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"A daily song, a weekly night and a monthly long night, the same monsters "
