msgid ""
"Lamp out: a thin whistle of draught across empty glass. It pulses from the "
"wall where a lamp needs lighting, louder as you come near."
msgstr "灭了的灯：风吹过空玻璃时细细的哨声。它从需要点灯的那面墙一阵阵传来，越靠近越响。"

msgid ""
"Lamp burning: the small flutter of a candle flame. You hear it from the "
"wall as you pass a lamp that is lit."
msgstr "亮着的灯：烛火轻轻的扑动声。你经过一盏亮着的灯时，会从那面墙听到它。"

msgid ""
"Lighting: a match strike flaring into a glass ting. The lamp you reached "
"for is lit."
msgstr "点灯：划火柴的声音，接着一声清脆的玻璃叮。你伸手够的那盏灯点亮了。"

msgid ""
"Bare wall: one dull knock. There is no lamp on that wall at this step."
msgstr "空墙：一下闷响。这一步的那面墙上没有灯。"

msgid "Already burning: a soft felt knock. That lamp is lit already."
msgstr "已经亮着：一下轻柔的毛毡敲击声。那盏灯已经亮了。"

msgid "Footstep: a soft step on wooden boards, one step along the hall."
msgstr "脚步声：木地板上轻轻的一步，沿着长廊走了一步。"

msgid ""
"Lobby door: a door creaking on its hinges. You are at the lobby end of the "
"hall."
msgstr "大厅门口：门轴吱呀作响。你在长廊靠大厅的一端。"

msgid "Far wall: two hollow knocks. You are at the far end of the hall."
msgstr "尽头的墙：两下空洞的敲击声。你在长廊的尽头。"

msgid "Taper low: a low, muted bell. The taper has 20 seconds left."
msgstr "引火烛快烧完：一声低沉、闷闷的铃。引火烛还剩20秒。"

msgid ""
"Taper out: a short puff. The taper burned down, and the taper bonus is gone."
msgstr "引火烛烧完：短促的噗一声。引火烛烧完了，引火烛奖励分没了。"

msgid ""
"Fresh taper: a quick match. Mabel lit you a new taper, so you can carry on."
msgstr "新的引火烛：快速划一根火柴。Mabel给你点了一根新的引火烛，你可以继续。"

msgid ""
"Draught: a long gust through a doorway. It blew a lamp out somewhere in the "
"hall."
msgstr "穿堂风：一阵长长的风从门口吹进来。它吹灭了长廊里某处的一盏灯。"

msgid ""
"Hall lit: a rising run of glass. Every lamp is burning, and the round is "
"over."
msgstr "长廊点亮：一串上升的玻璃声。每一盏灯都亮了，这一轮结束了。"

msgid "Return to the Lamplighter title."
msgstr "返回Lamplighter标题菜单。"

