msgstr "{festival_when}开放，庆祝元宵节：{FESTIVAL_LANTERNS}盏灯笼，还有寺庙的钟声。{best}"

msgid "the full moon"
msgstr "满月"

msgid ""
"Twenty lanterns on the lake, and temple bells ring in the song's last voice."
msgstr "湖上有二十盏灯笼，寺庙的钟声奏响歌曲的最后一个声部。"

msgid "Full moon"
msgstr "满月"

#. placeholders: {moon}
msgid "Under {moon}, a wolf howls far off across the lake."
msgstr "在{moon}下，一只狼在湖对岸远远地嚎叫。"

