#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Kept on a board of its own.{best}{last}"
msgstr "在单独的排行榜上计分。{best}{last}"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Temple bells ring in the last voice, in place of the choir."
msgstr "寺庙的钟声奏响最后一个声部，取代合唱。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The Lantern Festival, 15 days into the Lunar New Year."
msgstr "元宵节，农历新年的第15天。"

#. placeholders: {FESTIVAL_LANTERNS}, {best}, {last}
msgid ""
"The Lantern Festival, 15 days into the Lunar New Year. {FESTIVAL_LANTERNS} "
"lanterns drift on a wide lake, and a new voice joins the song with every "
"second one. Temple bells ring in the last voice, in place of the choir. "
"Kept on a board of its own.{best}{last}"
msgstr ""
"元宵节，农历新年的第15天。{FESTIVAL_LANTERNS}盏灯笼漂在一片宽阔的湖上，每收集两盏，歌里就多一个新声部。寺庙的钟声奏响最后一个声部，"
"取代合唱。在单独的排行榜上计分。{best}{last}"

#. placeholders: {FESTIVAL_LANTERNS}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{FESTIVAL_LANTERNS} lanterns drift on a wide lake, and a new voice joins "
"the song with every second one."
msgstr "{FESTIVAL_LANTERNS}盏灯笼漂在一片宽阔的湖上，每收集两盏，歌里就多一个新声部。"

