msgid ""
"You drift up to an old wooden dock. Its boards creak, and water slaps "
"softly against the posts."
msgstr "你漂到一座旧木码头旁。木板吱呀作响，水轻轻拍打着桩子。"

msgid ""
"Your canoe nudges a small rocky island. High in a pine, an owl watches you "
"and hoots."
msgstr "你的独木舟碰到了一座多岩石的小岛。高高的松树上，一只猫头鹰看着你，咕咕地叫。"

msgid ""
"Fireflies rise from a meadow on the shore, hundreds of them, blinking over "
"the water."
msgstr "萤火虫从岸边的草地上飞起来，成百上千只，在水面上闪烁。"

msgid "A little stream tumbles into the lake here, bubbling over stones."
msgstr "一条小溪在这里流进湖里，在石头上咕嘟冒泡。"

msgid ""
"You glide into a patch of lily pads. A bullfrog grumbles and plops into the "
"water."
msgstr "你滑进一片睡莲叶。一只牛蛙咕哝一声，扑通跳进水里。"

msgid ""
"An old bell buoy rocks gently, and its bell rings low across the lake."
msgstr "一个旧铃铛浮标轻轻摇晃，它的铃声低低地传遍湖面。"

msgid ""
"A beaver lodge of sticks and mud. Something inside gnaws, then slaps its "
"tail on the water."
msgstr "一座用树枝和泥巴搭的河狸窝。里面有什么在啃东西，然后用尾巴拍了一下水。"

msgid ""
"A weeping willow trails its branches in the water, whispering as you pass "
"beneath."
msgstr "一棵垂柳把枝条垂进水里，你从下面经过时，它沙沙低语。"

