msgstr "静水"

msgid "Breezy night"
msgstr "微风之夜"

msgid "Starry night"
msgstr "星夜"

msgid "Lantern constellation"
msgstr "灯笼星座"

msgid "Lantern festival"
msgstr "灯会"

msgid ""
"Mist covers the far side of the lake: the lanterns are faint until you are "
