msgstr ""
"{name}也住在这里。{sentence_start}告诉你哪里需要照看，还有多少粮食。马上再按一次听日期和存货，再按一次听每个人的心情和工作。沿着小"
"路找到{name}，按Enter交谈。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} tells you what needs attention and how much food you have."
msgstr "{sentence_start}告诉你哪里需要照看，还有多少粮食。"

msgid "A word with a settler cheers them up, and they say what they want."
msgstr "和村民说说话能让他们开心，他们还会说出想要什么。"

msgid ""
"Larkfield is an empty river hamlet, and you are its first farmer. Settlers "
"come to stay, and each has a story to finish. Learn in a practice hamlet "
"that is never kept"
msgstr ""
"Larkfield是一座空荡荡的河边小村，你是这里的第一个农夫。村民会来定居，每个人都有一段故事要完成。在一座从不保存的练习小村里学着玩"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "At the end of the day, everyone eats supper from the larder."
msgstr "一天结束时，大家用储藏室的粮食吃晚饭。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Settlers work on their own, at what they are best at."
msgstr "村民会自己干活，干他们最擅长的事。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
msgid ""
"Settlers work on their own, at what they are best at. At the end of the "
"day, everyone eats supper from the larder. {sentence_start} says what to do "
"next whenever you are unsure."
msgstr ""
"村民会自己干活，干他们最擅长的事。一天结束时，大家用储藏室的粮食吃晚饭。拿不准的时候，{sentence_start}会告诉你下一步做什么。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} says what to do next whenever you are unsure."
msgstr "拿不准的时候，{sentence_start}会告诉你下一步做什么。"

msgid ""
"Direct a Fourth of July fireworks show. Listen to each level, then repeat "
"its fireworks in the right places and at the right moments. Twenty levels, "
"a freestyle mode for your own shows, and a grand finale once they are all "
"cleared. A level clears at 60 or more out of 100."
msgstr ""
"指挥一场美国独立日烟花表演。听完每一关，再在正确的位置和时刻重放它的烟花。共二十关，还有自由编排模式让你做自己的表演，全部通关后有压轴大秀。一关拿到10"
"0分中的60分以上就算通关。"

msgid "Direct a Fourth of July fireworks show."
msgstr "指挥一场美国独立日烟花表演。"

msgid ""
"Listen to each level, then repeat its fireworks in the right places and at "
"the right moments."
msgstr "听完每一关，再在正确的位置和时刻重放它的烟花。"

msgid ""
"Twenty levels, a freestyle mode for your own shows, and a grand finale once "
"they are all cleared."
msgstr "共二十关，还有自由编排模式让你做自己的表演，全部通关后有压轴大秀。"

msgid "A level clears at 60 or more out of 100."
msgstr "一关拿到100分中的60分以上就算通关。"

msgid ""
"Title menu: Play starts your next uncleared level. Grand finale opens after "
"level 20. Freestyle composes, saves, and replays your shows. Level select "
"plays any of the twenty levels. Independence night opens on the Fourth of "
"July. Challenges holds daily, weekly, and monthly. Practice room is an "
"unscored launch range. Tutorial is a short walkthrough. Help is this guide. "
"Sound check plays the gameplay cues. Records reads back your best scores. "
"Settings changes speech, volume and controls."
msgstr ""
"标题菜单：开始进入你下一个未通关的关卡。压轴大秀在第20关之后开放。自由编排用来创作、保存和重放你的表演。选关可以玩二十关中的任意一关。独立之夜在7月4"
"日开放。挑战里有每日、每周和每月挑战。练习室是不计分的发射场。教程是一段简短的引导。帮助就是这份指南。音效试听播放游戏中的提示音。纪录读出你的最高分。设"
"置用来调整语音、音量和控制。"

msgid "Title menu: Play starts your next uncleared level."
msgstr "标题菜单：开始进入你下一个未通关的关卡。"

msgid "Grand finale opens after level 20."
msgstr "压轴大秀在第20关之后开放。"

msgid "Freestyle composes, saves, and replays your shows."
msgstr "自由编排用来创作、保存和重放你的表演。"

msgid "Level select plays any of the twenty levels."
msgstr "选关可以玩二十关中的任意一关。"

msgid "Challenges holds daily, weekly, and monthly."
msgstr "挑战里有每日、每周和每月挑战。"

msgid "Practice room is an unscored launch range."
msgstr "练习室是不计分的发射场。"

msgid "Tutorial is a short walkthrough."
msgstr "教程是一段简短的引导。"

msgid "Help is this guide."
msgstr "帮助就是这份指南。"

msgid "Sound check plays the gameplay cues."
msgstr "音效试听播放游戏中的提示音。"

msgid "Records reads back your best scores."
msgstr "纪录读出你的最高分。"

msgid "Settings changes speech, volume and controls."
msgstr "设置用来调整语音、音量和控制。"

msgid "A round"
msgstr "一轮"

msgid ""
"Press Space, the main action, to hear the show. It starts with a count-in: "
"three count-in ticks half a second apart, then the go cue. The go is time "
"zero."
msgstr "按Space，也就是主操作，听这场表演。开头有预备拍：三声预备拍，每声间隔半秒，然后是开始提示音。开始的那一刻是零秒。"

msgid "Press Space, the main action, to hear the show."
msgstr "按Space，也就是主操作，听这场表演。"

msgid ""
"It starts with a count-in: three count-in ticks half a second apart, then "
"the go cue."
msgstr "开头有预备拍：三声预备拍，每声间隔半秒，然后是开始提示音。"

msgid ""
"The fireworks go up. Two seconds after the last one, the game says \"Your "
"turn\"."
msgstr "烟花升空。最后一枚升空两秒后，游戏会说“轮到你了”。"

msgid "The fireworks go up."
msgstr "烟花升空。"

msgid "Two seconds after the last one, the game says \"Your turn\"."
msgstr "最后一枚升空两秒后，游戏会说“轮到你了”。"

msgid ""
"Press Space again for your own count-in, the same as the show's. Launch "
"each firework at the moment it went up in the show, measured from the go."
msgstr "再按Space开始你自己的预备拍，和表演的一样。从开始那一刻算起，在每枚烟花升空的同一时刻发射它。"

msgid "Press Space again for your own count-in, the same as the show's."
msgstr "再按Space开始你自己的预备拍，和表演的一样。"

msgid ""
"Launch each firework at the moment it went up in the show, measured from "
"the go."
msgstr "从开始那一刻算起，在每枚烟花升空的同一时刻发射它。"

msgid ""
"Press Enter when you are finished. The crowd reacts, then the game reads "
"your score."
msgstr "发射完后按Enter。观众会有反应，然后游戏读出你的得分。"

msgid "Press Enter when you are finished."
msgstr "发射完后按Enter。"

msgid "The crowd reacts, then the game reads your score."
msgstr "观众会有反应，然后游戏读出你的得分。"

msgid ""
"Once the show has played, Tab, the second action, plays it again. That "
"clears anything you have launched so far."
msgstr "表演播放过后，Tab，也就是第二操作，可以再播一遍。这会清掉你已经发射的所有烟花。"

msgid "Once the show has played, Tab, the second action, plays it again."
msgstr "表演播放过后，Tab，也就是第二操作，可以再播一遍。"

msgid "That clears anything you have launched so far."
msgstr "这会清掉你已经发射的所有烟花。"

msgid "Choosing with Up and Down"
msgstr "用Up和Down选择"

msgid ""
"While you launch, Space, the main action, does whatever you have chosen, "
"and Up and Down step through the choices: boom, crackle, whistle, sparkle, "
"take back the last firework, and finish the show. It starts on boom, and a "
"number key chooses its firework as it launches it, so Space then launches "
"that kind again. This is how you play on a controller: A launches, Up and "
"Down on the d-pad choose, and holding Left or Right on the d-pad aims. "
"Enter on the keyboard still finishes, and Backspace still takes back."
msgstr ""
"发射时，Space，也就是主操作，执行你选中的那一项，Up和Down在选项间切换：轰鸣、噼啪、哨音、闪光、收回上一枚烟花，以及结束表演。一开始选的是轰鸣"
"，按数字键会选中并发射对应的烟花，之后按Space就会再发射同一种。手柄上这样玩：A发射，十字键Up和Down选择，按住十字键Left或Right瞄准。"
"键盘上的Enter照样结束，Backspace照样收回。"

msgid ""
"While you launch, Space, the main action, does whatever you have chosen, "
"and Up and Down step through the choices: boom, crackle, whistle, sparkle, "
"take back the last firework, and finish the show."
msgstr ""
"发射时，Space，也就是主操作，执行你选中的那一项，Up和Down在选项间切换：轰鸣、噼啪、哨音、闪光、收回上一枚烟花，以及结束表演。"

msgid ""
"It starts on boom, and a number key chooses its firework as it launches it, "
"so Space then launches that kind again."
msgstr "一开始选的是轰鸣，按数字键会选中并发射对应的烟花，之后按Space就会再发射同一种。"

msgid ""
"This is how you play on a controller: A launches, Up and Down on the d-pad "
"choose, and holding Left or Right on the d-pad aims."
msgstr "手柄上这样玩：A发射，十字键Up和Down选择，按住十字键Left或Right瞄准。"

msgid ""
"Enter on the keyboard still finishes, and Backspace still takes back."
msgstr "键盘上的Enter照样结束，Backspace照样收回。"

msgid "1: launch a boom."
msgstr "1：发射轰鸣。"

msgid "2: launch a crackle."
msgstr "2：发射噼啪。"

msgid "3: launch a whistle."
msgstr "3：发射哨音。"

msgid "4: launch a sparkle."
msgstr "4：发射闪光。"

msgid "The number keys on the keypad work too."
msgstr "小键盘上的数字键也能用。"

msgid "Left, center and right"
msgstr "左、中、右"

msgid ""
"From level 11, fireworks also go up on the left or the right. Hold the Left "
"arrow or A while you press a number to launch on the left. Hold the Right "
"arrow or D for the right. With neither held, the firework goes up in the "
"center. Pressing Left or Right on its own plays the aim cue on that side, "
"so you can check where you are aiming."
msgstr ""
"从第11关起，烟花也会在左边或右边升空。按住Left方向键或A再按数字，就在左边发射。按住Right方向键或D就在右边。两个都不按，烟花在中间升空。单独"
"按Left或Right会在那一侧播放瞄准提示音，方便你确认瞄准的方向。"

msgid "From level 11, fireworks also go up on the left or the right."
msgstr "从第11关起，烟花也会在左边或右边升空。"

msgid ""
"Hold the Left arrow or A while you press a number to launch on the left."
msgstr "按住Left方向键或A再按数字，就在左边发射。"

msgid "Hold the Right arrow or D for the right."
msgstr "按住Right方向键或D就在右边。"

msgid "With neither held, the firework goes up in the center."
msgstr "两个都不按，烟花在中间升空。"

msgid ""
"Pressing Left or Right on its own plays the aim cue on that side, so you "
"can check where you are aiming."
msgstr "单独按Left或Right会在那一侧播放瞄准提示音，方便你确认瞄准的方向。"

msgid ""
"Each firework in the show is matched with whichever of your launches fits "
"it best:"
msgstr "表演中的每枚烟花，会和你发射的烟花里最吻合的那一枚配对："

msgid "50 points for the right kind of firework."
msgstr "烟花种类对了得50分。"

msgid "25 points for the right place."
msgstr "位置对了得25分。"

msgid ""
"Up to 25 points for timing: 25 within a tenth of a second, 20 within 0.3 "
"seconds, 15 within half a second, 10 within a second, 5 within two seconds."
msgstr "时机最多得25分：误差在十分之一秒内得25分，0.3秒内得20分，半秒内得15分，一秒内得10分，两秒内得5分。"

msgid ""
"Every firework too many or too few takes 20 points off. The total is your "
"score out of 100. 60 or more clears the level."
msgstr "每多一枚或少一枚烟花扣20分。总分就是你的得分，满分100。60分以上通关。"

msgid "Every firework too many or too few takes 20 points off."
msgstr "每多一枚或少一枚烟花扣20分。"

msgid "The total is your score out of 100."
msgstr "总分就是你的得分，满分100。"

msgid "60 or more clears the level."
msgstr "60分以上通关。"

msgid "Combos and show points"
msgstr "连击和表演分"

msgid ""
"A firework matched almost perfectly, with the right kind and place and "
"within 0.3 seconds, starts a combo, and each next firework in the show "
"matched as well adds to it. Each step of a combo is worth bonus points: 50 "
"for the second in a row, 100 for the third, and so on. Combo bonuses are "
"paid only when the show clears, at 60 or more."
msgstr ""
"一枚烟花配得几乎完美，种类和位置都对，误差在0.3秒内，就开始一次连击，表演中接下来每枚同样配得好的烟花都会让连击继续。连击的每一步都有奖励分：连续第二"
"枚50分，第三枚100分，以此类推。只有表演通关，也就是60分以上，才发放连击奖励分。"

msgid ""
"A firework matched almost perfectly, with the right kind and place and "
"within 0.3 seconds, starts a combo, and each next firework in the show "
"matched as well adds to it."
msgstr "一枚烟花配得几乎完美，种类和位置都对，误差在0.3秒内，就开始一次连击，表演中接下来每枚同样配得好的烟花都会让连击继续。"

msgid ""
"Each step of a combo is worth bonus points: 50 for the second in a row, 100 "
"for the third, and so on."
msgstr "连击的每一步都有奖励分：连续第二枚50分，第三枚100分，以此类推。"

msgid "Combo bonuses are paid only when the show clears, at 60 or more."
msgstr "只有表演通关，也就是60分以上，才发放连击奖励分。"

msgid ""
"Show points are your score times ten, plus combo bonuses. Every level keeps "
"its best show points. Your run total is the points of every level cleared "
"in a row from where you started, and it keeps a best too. Replaying a level "
"starts it again from the run total you had before it, so a level counts "
"once. Saving a new freestyle show clears the best score of the one it "
"replaces."
msgstr ""
"表演分是你的得分乘以十，再加上连击奖励分。每一关都保留它的最高表演分。你的一局总分是从起点开始连续通关的每一关的分数之和，它也有最高分。重玩一关时，会从"
"这一关之前的一局总分重新算起，所以每关只算一次。保存一场新的自由编排表演，会清除被替换的那一场的最高分。"

msgid "Show points are your score times ten, plus combo bonuses."
msgstr "表演分是你的得分乘以十，再加上连击奖励分。"

msgid "Every level keeps its best show points."
msgstr "每一关都保留它的最高表演分。"

msgid ""
"Your run total is the points of every level cleared in a row from where you "
"started, and it keeps a best too."
msgstr "你的一局总分是从起点开始连续通关的每一关的分数之和，它也有最高分。"

msgid ""
"Replaying a level starts it again from the run total you had before it, so "
"a level counts once."
msgstr "重玩一关时，会从这一关之前的一局总分重新算起，所以每关只算一次。"

msgid ""
"Saving a new freestyle show clears the best score of the one it replaces."
msgstr "保存一场新的自由编排表演，会清除被替换的那一场的最高分。"

msgid "A hint takes 15 points off your score."
msgstr "用一次提示扣15分。"

msgid "Levels"
msgstr "关卡"

msgid "Levels 1 to 5: one firework. Match its kind and its moment."
msgstr "第1到5关：一枚烟花。对上它的种类和时刻。"

msgid "Levels 1 to 5: one firework."
msgstr "第1到5关：一枚烟花。"

msgid "Match its kind and its moment."
msgstr "对上它的种类和时刻。"

msgid "Levels 6 to 10: two fireworks."
msgstr "第6到10关：两枚烟花。"

msgid "Levels 11 to 15: three fireworks, on the left, center or right."
msgstr "第11到15关：三枚烟花，在左、中或右。"

msgid ""
"Levels 16 to 20: four to eight fireworks, and some go up early, overlapping "
"the one before."
msgstr "第16到20关：四到八枚烟花，有些会提前升空，和前一枚叠在一起。"

msgid ""
"After level 1, a show may start up to two seconds after the go, so match "
"when the first firework goes up as well as what it is."
msgstr "第1关之后，表演可能在开始后最多两秒才开始，所以除了对上第一枚烟花是什么，还要对上它何时升空。"

msgid ""
"Challenges on the title, or Challenges in the lobby, holds three challenges "
"that are the same for every player and change on their own: the daily each "
"day, the weekly each Monday, the monthly on the first of the month. Each "
"row names the challenge and what it is, then your result so far and your "
"streak. Choosing one reads a short briefing, with the twist and how long "
"until the next one. Enter on its last page starts the first show, and "
"Escape goes back without starting. A challenge counts when its last show is "
"over. Leaving by Leave the challenge on the pause menu, or by Back to the "
"challenges between shows, does not count it. Your score is the show points "
"of every show added up, and the results say your result, your best and your "
"streak."
msgstr ""
"标题菜单里的挑战，或大厅里的挑战，有三个对每位玩家都一样、会自动更换的挑战：每日挑战每天换，每周挑战每周一换，每月挑战每月1号换。每一行说出挑战名称和内"
"容，然后是你目前的成绩和连胜。选中一个会读一段简短的简报，包括变化和距离下一个还有多久。在最后一页按Enter开始第一场表演，按Escape不开始直接返"
"回。挑战在最后一场表演结束时才算数。用暂停菜单的离开挑战，或在表演之间用回到挑战离开，都不算数。你的得分是所有表演的表演分之和，结算会说出你的成绩、你的"
"最高分和连胜。"

msgid ""
"Challenges on the title, or Challenges in the lobby, holds three challenges "
"that are the same for every player and change on their own: the daily each "
"day, the weekly each Monday, the monthly on the first of the month."
msgstr "标题菜单里的挑战，或大厅里的挑战，有三个对每位玩家都一样、会自动更换的挑战：每日挑战每天换，每周挑战每周一换，每月挑战每月1号换。"

msgid ""
"Each row names the challenge and what it is, then your result so far and "
"your streak."
msgstr "每一行说出挑战名称和内容，然后是你目前的成绩和连胜。"

msgid ""
"Choosing one reads a short briefing, with the twist and how long until the "
"next one."
msgstr "选中一个会读一段简短的简报，包括变化和距离下一个还有多久。"

msgid ""
"Enter on its last page starts the first show, and Escape goes back without "
"starting."
msgstr "在最后一页按Enter开始第一场表演，按Escape不开始直接返回。"

msgid "A challenge counts when its last show is over."
msgstr "挑战在最后一场表演结束时才算数。"

msgid ""
"Leaving by Leave the challenge on the pause menu, or by Back to the "
"challenges between shows, does not count it."
msgstr "用暂停菜单的离开挑战，或在表演之间用回到挑战离开，都不算数。"

msgid ""
"Your score is the show points of every show added up, and the results say "
"your result, your best and your streak."
msgstr "你的得分是所有表演的表演分之和，结算会说出你的成绩、你的最高分和连胜。"

msgid ""
"Daily, tonight's show: one show from the harder half of the campaign, "
"levels 11 to 20, under a twist."
msgstr "每日挑战，今晚的表演：从战役后半段第11到20关中选一场表演，加上一条变化。"

msgid ""
"Weekly, the five-show gauntlet: five shows in a row, each bigger than the "
"last, under the week's twist. A show under 60 percent ends the gauntlet. "
"Its points still count."
msgstr "每周挑战，五场连闯：连续五场表演，一场比一场大，加上本周的变化。有一场低于百分之60，连闯就结束。它的分数照样算。"

msgid ""
"Weekly, the five-show gauntlet: five shows in a row, each bigger than the "
"last, under the week's twist."
msgstr "每周挑战，五场连闯：连续五场表演，一场比一场大，加上本周的变化。"

msgid "A show under 60 percent ends the gauntlet."
msgstr "有一场低于百分之60，连闯就结束。"

msgid "Its points still count."
msgstr "它的分数照样算。"

msgid ""
"Monthly, the festival: a themed festival, such as Independence Day in July, "
"with two acts and a 14-firework finale. Every act is played, whatever it "
"scores. The festival celebrates one firework, its signature, and its shows "
"are full of them: on a show that clears, each signature firework matched "
"near-perfectly, with the right kind and place within 0.3 seconds, adds 100 "
"bonus points."
msgstr ""
"每月挑战，节庆：一场主题节庆，比如7月的独立日，有两幕和一段14枚烟花的压轴。每一幕都会演完，不管得分多少。节庆主打一种烟花，叫招牌烟花，表演里满是这种"
"烟花：在通关的表演中，每枚配得几乎完美的招牌烟花，种类和位置都对且误差在0.3秒内，加100奖励分。"

msgid ""
"Monthly, the festival: a themed festival, such as Independence Day in July, "
"with two acts and a 14-firework finale."
msgstr "每月挑战，节庆：一场主题节庆，比如7月的独立日，有两幕和一段14枚烟花的压轴。"

msgid "Every act is played, whatever it scores."
msgstr "每一幕都会演完，不管得分多少。"

msgid ""
"The festival celebrates one firework, its signature, and its shows are full "
"of them: on a show that clears, each signature firework matched "
"near-perfectly, with the right kind and place within 0.3 seconds, adds 100 "
"bonus points."
msgstr ""
"节庆主打一种烟花，叫招牌烟花，表演里满是这种烟花：在通关的表演中，每枚配得几乎完美的招牌烟花，种类和位置都对且误差在0.3秒内，加100奖励分。"

msgid ""
"Quickstep: the shows play at double speed, fireworks a second apart instead "
"of two."
msgstr "快步：表演以两倍速播放，烟花间隔一秒而不是两秒。"

msgid ""
"Tough crowd: timing points only within 0.3 seconds. Any firework further "
"off earns none."
msgstr "挑剔的观众：只有误差在0.3秒内才有时机分。差得更多的烟花一分不得。"

msgid "Tough crowd: timing points only within 0.3 seconds."
msgstr "挑剔的观众：只有误差在0.3秒内才有时机分。"

msgid "Any firework further off earns none."
msgstr "差得更多的烟花一分不得。"

msgid "One shot: each show plays only once, with no replay and no hints."
msgstr "一次机会：每场表演只播一次，不能重播，也没有提示。"

msgid ""
"Night fog: the show is harder to hear, but firework positions and your own "
"launches are unchanged. Practise the fog boom in Sound check."
msgstr "夜雾：表演更难听清，但烟花的位置和你自己的发射不变。在音效试听里练练雾中的轰鸣。"

msgid ""
"Night fog: the show is harder to hear, but firework positions and your own "
"launches are unchanged."
msgstr "夜雾：表演更难听清，但烟花的位置和你自己的发射不变。"

msgid "Practise the fog boom in Sound check."
msgstr "在音效试听里练练雾中的轰鸣。"

msgid ""
"After a level that clears: Next level, Play again, Hear the results again, "
"Compare, and Back to the title. Play again plays the level with a new show. "
"Hear the results again reads the result, then how well each firework "
"matched. Compare plays the show, then your own launches, each after a "
"count-in. After a level that does not clear, Try again plays a new show and "
"Practice this level plays the very same one again. Escape does what Back to "
"the title does."
msgstr ""
"通关一关后：下一关、再来一局、再听一遍结算、对比，以及回到标题菜单。再来一局用一场新表演重玩这一关。再听一遍结算会读出成绩，然后是每枚烟花配得怎样。对比"
"先播放表演，再播放你自己的发射，每段之前都有预备拍。没通关时，再试一次播放一场新表演，练习这一关会原样再播同一场。Escape和回到标题菜单的作用一样。"

msgid ""
"After a level that clears: Next level, Play again, Hear the results again, "
"Compare, and Back to the title."
msgstr "通关一关后：下一关、再来一局、再听一遍结算、对比，以及回到标题菜单。"

msgid "Play again plays the level with a new show."
msgstr "再来一局用一场新表演重玩这一关。"

msgid ""
"Hear the results again reads the result, then how well each firework "
"matched."
msgstr "再听一遍结算会读出成绩，然后是每枚烟花配得怎样。"

msgid ""
"Compare plays the show, then your own launches, each after a count-in."
msgstr "对比先播放表演，再播放你自己的发射，每段之前都有预备拍。"

msgid ""
"After a level that does not clear, Try again plays a new show and Practice "
"this level plays the very same one again."
msgstr "没通关时，再试一次播放一场新表演，练习这一关会原样再播同一场。"

msgid "Escape does what Back to the title does."
msgstr "Escape和回到标题菜单的作用一样。"

msgid ""
"After a challenge show, the results end with Back to the challenges. "
"Between the shows of a weekly or monthly challenge, the first row goes on "
"to the next show."
msgstr "挑战表演结束后，结算最后一项是回到挑战。在每周或每月挑战的各场表演之间，第一行会进入下一场表演。"

msgid "After a challenge show, the results end with Back to the challenges."
msgstr "挑战表演结束后，结算最后一项是回到挑战。"

msgid ""
"Between the shows of a weekly or monthly challenge, the first row goes on "
"to the next show."
msgstr "在每周或每月挑战的各场表演之间，第一行会进入下一场表演。"

msgid "Freestyle"
msgstr "自由编排"

msgid ""
"Compose a show of your own: launch with 1 to 4, aiming with Left and Right, "
"with no score and no clock to beat. Your show's time starts at your first "
"launch. Backspace takes back the last firework. Enter finishes. Afterwards "
"you can play your show with the crowd watching, save it, or choose Play "
"again to start another. A saved show can be heard again from the freestyle "
"menu, or played with Match your saved show, scored like a level."
msgstr ""
"编排一场你自己的表演：用1到4发射，用Left和Right瞄准，不计分，也不限时。你的表演从第一次发射开始计时。Backspace收回上一枚烟花。Ent"
"er结束。之后你可以在观众面前演出你的表演、保存它，或选再来一局重新编排一场。保存的表演可以在自由编排菜单里重听，也可以用对上你保存的表演来玩，像关卡一"
"样计分。"

msgid ""
"Compose a show of your own: launch with 1 to 4, aiming with Left and Right, "
"with no score and no clock to beat."
msgstr "编排一场你自己的表演：用1到4发射，用Left和Right瞄准，不计分，也不限时。"

msgid "Enter finishes."
msgstr "Enter结束。"

msgid ""
"Afterwards you can play your show with the crowd watching, save it, or "
"choose Play again to start another."
msgstr "之后你可以在观众面前演出你的表演、保存它，或选再来一局重新编排一场。"

msgid ""
"A saved show can be heard again from the freestyle menu, or played with "
"Match your saved show, scored like a level."
msgstr "保存的表演可以在自由编排菜单里重听，也可以用对上你保存的表演来玩，像关卡一样计分。"

msgid ""
"Clear level 20 to open the grand finale: an endless run of shows, each "
"longer and faster than the last, with fireworks all over the sky. It goes "
"on until a round scores under 60. Your finale total is kept as a best score."
msgstr ""
"通过第20关就能开启压轴大秀：一场接一场没有尽头的表演，每场都比上一场更长更快，烟花布满整个夜空。直到某一轮低于60分才结束。你的压轴总分会记为最高分。"

msgid ""
"Clear level 20 to open the grand finale: an endless run of shows, each "
"longer and faster than the last, with fireworks all over the sky."
msgstr "通过第20关就能开启压轴大秀：一场接一场没有尽头的表演，每场都比上一场更长更快，烟花布满整个夜空。"

msgid "It goes on until a round scores under 60."
msgstr "直到某一轮低于60分才结束。"

msgid "Your finale total is kept as a best score."
msgstr "你的压轴总分会记为最高分。"

msgid ""
"On the Fourth of July, the Independence night row on the title opens a show "
"built for the day. It counts as the day from the 3rd to the 5th of July, so "
"it is open on the Fourth wherever you are. The rest of the year the row "
"reads Independence night, locked, and F1 on it says how many days are left."
msgstr ""
"7月4日，标题菜单上的独立之夜一行会打开一场为这一天准备的表演。7月3日到5日都算这一天，所以不管你在哪里，7月4日都能玩。一年中其他时候，这一行显示独"
"立之夜，未解锁，在上面按F1会说还剩几天。"

msgid ""
"On the Fourth of July, the Independence night row on the title opens a show "
"built for the day."
msgstr "7月4日，标题菜单上的独立之夜一行会打开一场为这一天准备的表演。"

msgid ""
"It counts as the day from the 3rd to the 5th of July, so it is open on the "
"Fourth wherever you are."
msgstr "7月3日到5日都算这一天，所以不管你在哪里，7月4日都能玩。"

msgid ""
"The rest of the year the row reads Independence night, locked, and F1 on it "
"says how many days are left."
msgstr "一年中其他时候，这一行显示独立之夜，未解锁，在上面按F1会说还剩几天。"

msgid "The night has four acts, each played whatever it scores:"
msgstr "这一夜有四幕，每一幕都会演完，不管得分多少："

msgid ""
"The opening salute: six booms, left and right, then two in the center. It "
"is the same every year."
msgstr "开场礼炮：六声轰鸣，分在左右，然后中间两声。每年都一样。"

msgid ""
"The opening salute: six booms, left and right, then two in the center."
msgstr "开场礼炮：六声轰鸣，分在左右，然后中间两声。"

msgid "It is the same every year."
msgstr "每年都一样。"

msgid "Stars and stripes: sparkles and crackles in turn, all over the sky."
msgstr "星条旗：闪光和噼啪轮流出现，布满夜空。"

msgid ""
"Whistles over the river: ten fireworks, most of them whistles, some going "
"up early."
msgstr "河上的哨音：十枚烟花，大多是哨音，有些会提前升空。"

msgid ""
"The grand finale: sixteen quick fireworks of every kind, then a closing "
"salute of four booms, left, center, right and center."
msgstr "压轴大秀：十六枚各式各样的快速烟花，最后是四声轰鸣的收尾礼炮，依次在左、中、右、中。"

msgid ""
"The boom is the night's signature firework. On an act that clears, every "
"boom matched near-perfectly, with the right place and within 0.3 seconds, "
"adds 100 bonus points."
msgstr "轰鸣是这一夜的招牌烟花。在通关的一幕中，每枚配得几乎完美的轰鸣，位置对且误差在0.3秒内，加100奖励分。"

msgid "The boom is the night's signature firework."
msgstr "轰鸣是这一夜的招牌烟花。"

msgid ""
"On an act that clears, every boom matched near-perfectly, with the right "
"place and within 0.3 seconds, adds 100 bonus points."
msgstr "在通关的一幕中，每枚配得几乎完美的轰鸣，位置对且误差在0.3秒内，加100奖励分。"

msgid ""
"In the week before the Fourth, Enter on the row plays a rehearsal of the "
"opening salute, so you can learn it early."
msgstr "7月4日前的一周里，在这一行按Enter会播放开场礼炮的彩排，让你提前熟悉。"

msgid ""
"When the last act is over, the night is kept as that year's keepsake: your "
"best show points and the most acts you cleared. Records reads every year's "
"keepsake."
msgstr "最后一幕结束后，这一夜会作为当年的纪念品保存：你的最高表演分和通关的最多幕数。纪录会读出每一年的纪念品。"

msgid ""
"When the last act is over, the night is kept as that year's keepsake: your "
"best show points and the most acts you cleared."
msgstr "最后一幕结束后，这一夜会作为当年的纪念品保存：你的最高表演分和通关的最多幕数。"

msgid ""
"The practice room is a launch range with nothing to score. Launch with 1 to "
"4 or Space, aiming with Left and Right, and each firework is named after it "
"goes up. Escape pauses."
msgstr "练习室是不计分的发射场。用1到4或Space发射，用Left和Right瞄准，每枚烟花升空后都会报出名字。Escape暂停。"

msgid "The practice room is a launch range with nothing to score."
msgstr "练习室是不计分的发射场。"

msgid ""
"Launch with 1 to 4 or Space, aiming with Left and Right, and each firework "
"is named after it goes up."
msgstr "用1到4或Space发射，用Left和Right瞄准，每枚烟花升空后都会报出名字。"

msgid ""
"Sound check plays the cues used to match a show. On each firework row, "
"Enter plays it in the center. Left and Right play it on that side."
msgstr "音效试听播放对上表演要用到的提示音。在每一行烟花上，Enter在中间播放它。Left和Right在那一侧播放。"

msgid "Sound check plays the cues used to match a show."
msgstr "音效试听播放对上表演要用到的提示音。"

msgid "On each firework row, Enter plays it in the center."
msgstr "在每一行烟花上，Enter在中间播放它。"

msgid "Left and Right play it on that side."
msgstr "Left和Right在那一侧播放。"

msgid "Controller"
msgstr "手柄"

msgid ""
"On a controller, A is the main action: it plays the show, starts your "
"count-in, and launches the firework you have chosen. Up and Down on the "
"d-pad choose a firework, take back or finish. Hold Left or Right on the "
"d-pad to launch on that side. X plays the show again, Y gives the status, "
"the left bumper gives a hint, a click of the right stick repeats the "
"instructions, Back reads help and B or Start pauses."
msgstr ""
"在手柄上，A是主操作：播放表演、开始你的预备拍、发射你选中的烟花。十字键Up和Down选择烟花、收回或结束。按住十字键Left或Right在那一侧发射。"
"X再播一遍表演，Y报告状态，左肩键给出提示，按下右摇杆重复说明，Back读帮助，B或Start暂停。"

msgid ""
"On a controller, A is the main action: it plays the show, starts your "
"count-in, and launches the firework you have chosen."
msgstr "在手柄上，A是主操作：播放表演、开始你的预备拍、发射你选中的烟花。"

msgid "Up and Down on the d-pad choose a firework, take back or finish."
msgstr "十字键Up和Down选择烟花、收回或结束。"

msgid "Hold Left or Right on the d-pad to launch on that side."
msgstr "按住十字键Left或Right在那一侧发射。"

msgid ""
"X plays the show again, Y gives the status, the left bumper gives a hint, a "
"click of the right stick repeats the instructions, Back reads help and B or "
"Start pauses."
msgstr "X再播一遍表演，Y报告状态，左肩键给出提示，按下右摇杆重复说明，Back读帮助，B或Start暂停。"

msgid ""
"Space: hear the show, start your count-in, or use the launch choice "
"selected with Up and Down."
msgstr "Space：听表演、开始你的预备拍，或执行用Up和Down选中的发射选项。"

msgid "1 to 4: launch a boom, crackle, whistle or sparkle."
msgstr "1到4：发射轰鸣、噼啪、哨音或闪光。"

msgid "Hold Left or A, Right or D: launch on that side."
msgstr "按住Left或A，Right或D：在那一侧发射。"

msgid "Enter: finish your show and score it."
msgstr "Enter：结束你的表演并计分。"

msgid ""
"Backspace: take back your last firework. Enter and Backspace cannot be "
"changed in Settings."
msgstr "Backspace：收回上一枚烟花。Enter和Backspace不能在设置里更改。"

msgid "Backspace: take back your last firework."
msgstr "Backspace：收回上一枚烟花。"

msgid "Enter and Backspace cannot be changed in Settings."
msgstr "Enter和Backspace不能在设置里更改。"

msgid "Tab: play the show again."
msgstr "Tab：再播一遍表演。"

msgid "R: repeat the instructions for where you are."
msgstr "R：重复你当前位置的说明。"

msgid ""
"S: the level, how many fireworks, how many you have launched and the time "
"since the go. Press it again straight away for the level's style, any "
"twist, and your points so far."
msgstr "S：关卡、烟花数量、你已发射的数量，以及开始后过了多久。马上再按一次，听关卡风格、变化和你目前的分数。"

msgid ""
"S: the level, how many fireworks, how many you have launched and the time "
"since the go."
msgstr "S：关卡、烟花数量、你已发射的数量，以及开始后过了多久。"

msgid ""
"Press it again straight away for the level's style, any twist, and your "
"points so far."
msgstr "马上再按一次，听关卡风格、变化和你目前的分数。"

msgid "H: a hint, the show described, for 15 points."
msgstr "H：提示，描述这场表演，扣15分。"

msgid ""
"Up and Down: choose what Space does while you launch, a firework, take "
"back, or finish."
msgstr "Up和Down：选择发射时Space做什么，发射烟花、收回或结束。"

msgid "Liberty Lights"
msgstr "Liberty Lights"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a challenge, Enter reads its briefing, Escape goes back. "
"Every player gets the same shows: a new daily each day, a weekly gauntlet "
"each Monday, a festival each month."
msgstr ""
"Up和Down选择挑战，Enter读简报，Escape返回。每位玩家的表演都一样：每天一个新的每日挑战，每周一一场每周连闯，每月一场节庆。"

msgid "Opening the Liberty Lights challenge."
msgstr "正在打开Liberty Lights挑战。"

