msgstr "今天每条溪流都有灯笼漂下来，每盏抵五片花瓣。"

msgid "Duck parade today."
msgstr "今天是鸭子游行。"

msgid "Lantern float today."
msgstr "今天是漂灯节。"

msgid ""
"Steer a little boat down a stream, catching what floats along with the "
"music."
msgstr "驾一条小船顺溪而下，随着音乐接住漂来的东西。"

