msgid ""
"A river with no end, made of every stream you have opened, busier as it "
"goes. Each bump makes the boat soggier. It sinks at 5 sogginess."
msgstr "一条没有尽头的河，由你开启的每条溪流组成，越往前越热闹。每撞一次船就更湿一些。湿度到5就会沉没。"

msgid "The endless river"
msgstr "无尽长河"

msgid "The endless river opens with your first star on Garden brook."
msgstr "在花园小溪拿到第一颗星，无尽长河就会开放。"

msgid "Reach the mouth of Garden brook to open a river with no end."
msgstr "到达花园小溪的河口，开启一条没有尽头的河。"

#. placeholders: {name}, {twist}
msgid "Sails {name}: {twist}."
msgstr "驶入{name}：{twist}。"

#. placeholders: {open}, {stars_phrase}
msgid "Choose a stream, {open} of 4 open, {stars_phrase}"
msgstr "选择溪流，4条中开放{open}条，{stars_phrase}"

msgid ""
"Choose a stream and hear its stars and best score. Earn stars to open more "
"streams."
msgstr "选一条溪流，听它的星数和最高分。得星可以开启更多溪流。"

msgid "Drift"
msgstr "漂流"

msgid ""
"Slow water and the whole band from the start. No score, and the banks only "
"nudge you."
msgstr "慢慢的水，整个乐队从一开始就在演奏。没有得分，河岸只会轻轻推你一下。"

msgid ""
"Your stars and bests on every stream, your boats, scraps, trinkets and "
"ribbons, and your challenge results."
msgstr "你在每条溪流的星数和最高分，你的船、纸片、小物件和绶带，以及挑战成绩。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
