msgid "It heads straight for you."
msgstr "它直奔你而来。"

#. placeholders: {WANDER_CHASE}
msgid "It wanders until it is {WANDER_CHASE} steps away, then chases."
msgstr "它随意游荡，直到离你{WANDER_CHASE}步以内，然后开始追。"

msgid "Next pantry opening."
msgstr "下一个食品间正在打开。"

msgid "Frozen. No freezes left."
