msgstr "茶罐盖：茶罐打开了。你的茶放进了壶里。"

msgid "Kettle switch: a click. The kettle is on."
msgstr "水壶开关：咔嗒一声。开始烧水了。"

msgid ""
"Rumble: the kettle's low song as it starts to warm, up to about 65 degrees."
msgstr "隆隆声：水壶开始变热时低沉的声音，到大约65度为止。"

msgid ""
"Hiss: the kettle's rushing song from about 80 degrees, rising toward the "
"boil."
msgstr "嘶声：大约80度起水壶呼呼的声音，一路升向沸腾。"

msgid "Whistle: a gentle whistle. The kettle is at the boil, 100 degrees."
msgstr "鸣笛：一声轻柔的鸣笛。水烧开了，100度。"

msgid "Pour: water from the kettle onto the leaves. The steep begins."
msgstr "冲水：壶里的水冲到茶叶上。浸泡开始。"

msgid "Clock tick: one second of steeping."
msgstr "时钟滴答声：浸泡了一秒。"

msgid ""
"Sand timer chime: the steep has reached what the tea wants. Only once you "
"own the sand timer."
msgstr "沙漏铃声：浸泡达到了茶需要的时间。只有买了沙漏才有。"

msgid "Leaves lifted: a drip and a swish. The steep is over."
msgstr "捞出茶叶：滴答一声，嗖的一下。浸泡结束。"

msgid "Cup filled: tea poured from the pot into one cup."
msgstr "倒满一杯：茶从壶里倒进一个杯子。"

msgid "Ice: cubes clink in the glass, for an iced tea."
msgstr "冰块：冰块在玻璃杯里叮当作响，用于冰茶。"

