msgstr "一款深沉的烟熏正山小种，黑得像没有月亮的夜晚。"

msgid "Spiced apple"
msgstr "香料苹果茶"

msgid "Dried apple, cinnamon and a little nutmeg."
msgstr "苹果干、肉桂和一点肉豆蔻。"

msgid "Plain white cup"
msgstr "普通白杯"

msgid "Your everyday cup. Good for anything."
msgstr "你日常用的杯子。什么茶都合适。"

