msgid "A cup as thin as an eggshell, for floral and sweet teas."
msgstr "一个薄得像蛋壳的杯子，适合花香和香甜的茶。"

msgid "The music box itself, with its first tune: a slow waltz."
msgstr "八音盒本身，带第一首曲子：一首慢华尔兹。"

msgid "A second tune for the music box, low and rolling."
msgstr "八音盒的第二首曲子，低沉而起伏。"

msgid "A third tune for the music box, bright and twinkling."
msgstr "八音盒的第三首曲子，明亮而闪烁。"

