msgid "Leaves out at {seconds_words}, {words}. {after}"
msgstr "在{seconds_words}时捞出茶叶，{words}。{after}"

msgid "The leaves steeped so long they came out on their own. Very strong."
msgstr "茶叶泡得太久，自己出来了。很浓。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} gives a hint at any time, such as where a guest's tea is "
"on your shelf."
msgstr "随时按{sentence_start}获得提示，比如客人要的茶在茶架的哪里。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} gives a hint at any time, such as where a guest's tea is "
"on your shelf. Press it now."
msgstr "随时按{sentence_start}获得提示，比如客人要的茶在茶架的哪里。现在按一下。"

msgid ""
"You keep a small tea house, at your own pace, and nothing here can go "
"wrong. Make a cup of Sencha now"
msgstr "你按自己的节奏经营一家小茶馆，这里不会出任何差错。现在泡一杯煎茶吧"

msgid ""
"Guests come in and say what they would like. Play opens the tea house, and "
"Practice brewing is a quiet place to learn the kettle."
msgstr "客人进门后会说出想要什么。开始会打开茶馆，练习泡茶是个安静的地方，可以熟悉水壶。"

msgid ""
"You skate across a frozen pond at night while the snow comes down. Lanterns "
"light ahead of you one at a time, each in one of five lanes across the ice. "
"You take a lantern by being in its lane as it reaches you."
msgstr "夜里下着雪，你在结冰的池塘上滑冰。前方的灯笼一盏接一盏亮起，每盏都在冰面上五条道中的一条里。灯笼到你面前时，你在它那条道上就能拿到它。"

msgid "You skate across a frozen pond at night while the snow comes down."
msgstr "夜里下着雪，你在结冰的池塘上滑冰。"

msgid ""
"Lanterns light ahead of you one at a time, each in one of five lanes across "
"the ice."
msgstr "前方的灯笼一盏接一盏亮起，每盏都在冰面上五条道中的一条里。"

msgid "You take a lantern by being in its lane as it reaches you."
msgstr "灯笼到你面前时，你在它那条道上就能拿到它。"

msgid ""
"Snow settles on the ice as you skate, and the night ends when it covers the "
"ice. Each lantern you take keeps the ice clear a little longer. Nothing "
"knocks you down: drifts slow you and thin ice makes you stumble, but the "
"skate goes on."
msgstr ""
"你滑冰时雪会落在冰面上，雪盖满冰面时，这一夜就结束了。你拿到的每盏灯笼都能让冰面多保持干净一会儿。什么都不会把你撞倒：雪堆让你慢下来，薄冰让你踉跄，但滑"
"冰会继续。"

msgid ""
"Snow settles on the ice as you skate, and the night ends when it covers the "
"ice."
msgstr "你滑冰时雪会落在冰面上，雪盖满冰面时，这一夜就结束了。"

msgid "Each lantern you take keeps the ice clear a little longer."
msgstr "你拿到的每盏灯笼都能让冰面多保持干净一会儿。"

msgid ""
"Nothing knocks you down: drifts slow you and thin ice makes you stumble, "
"but the skate goes on."
msgstr "什么都不会把你撞倒：雪堆让你慢下来，薄冰让你踉跄，但滑冰会继续。"

msgid "Leaning and lanes"
msgstr "倾身和冰道"

msgid ""
"Space pushes off. Hold Left or Right to lean that way, and you glide across "
"the ice while you hold. Let go and you skate straight on. The ice has five "
"lanes: far left, left, the middle, right and far right. You can be anywhere "
"between the banks, and a lantern counts as taken if you are close to its "
"lane."
msgstr ""
"按Space蹬冰出发。按住Left或Right往那边倾身，按住时你会在冰面上横向滑行。松开就会直直往前滑。冰面有五条道：最左、左、中间、右和最右。你可以"
"在两岸之间的任何地方，只要离灯笼的道够近，就算拿到了。"

msgid "Space pushes off."
msgstr "按Space蹬冰出发。"

msgid ""
"Hold Left or Right to lean that way, and you glide across the ice while you "
"hold."
msgstr "按住Left或Right往那边倾身，按住时你会在冰面上横向滑行。"

msgid "Let go and you skate straight on."
msgstr "松开就会直直往前滑。"

msgid ""
"The ice has five lanes: far left, left, the middle, right and far right."
msgstr "冰面有五条道：最左、左、中间、右和最右。"

msgid ""
"You can be anywhere between the banks, and a lantern counts as taken if you "
"are close to its lane."
msgstr "你可以在两岸之间的任何地方，只要离灯笼的道够近，就算拿到了。"

msgid "Lanterns and your line"
msgstr "灯笼和连串"

msgid ""
"A lantern lights a little way ahead of you and comes closer until it "
"passes. Be in its lane as it passes to take it. A lantern you miss goes by, "
"and your line starts again."
msgstr "灯笼在你前方不远处亮起，越来越近，直到经过你。它经过时你在它的道上，就能拿到它。错过的灯笼会过去，你的连串会重新开始。"

msgid ""
"A lantern lights a little way ahead of you and comes closer until it passes."
msgstr "灯笼在你前方不远处亮起，越来越近，直到经过你。"

msgid "Be in its lane as it passes to take it."
msgstr "它经过时你在它的道上，就能拿到它。"

msgid "A lantern you miss goes by, and your line starts again."
msgstr "错过的灯笼会过去，你的连串会重新开始。"

msgid ""
"Lanterns taken one after another make a line. The first in a line is worth "
"1 point, the second 2, and so on up to 5 points for every lantern after the "
"fourth."
msgstr "一盏接一盏拿到的灯笼组成连串。连串中第一盏值1分，第二盏2分，依此类推，第四盏之后的每一盏都值5分。"

msgid "Lanterns taken one after another make a line."
msgstr "一盏接一盏拿到的灯笼组成连串。"

msgid ""
"The first in a line is worth 1 point, the second 2, and so on up to 5 "
"points for every lantern after the fourth."
msgstr "连串中第一盏值1分，第二盏2分，依此类推，第四盏之后的每一盏都值5分。"

msgid "The snow"
msgstr "雪"

msgid ""
"The snow starts light and settles faster than you can stop it. Each lantern "
"you take sweeps some of the ice clear again. When the snow covers the ice, "
"the night is over, and the results follow."
msgstr "雪一开始下得很小，积得比你清得还快。你拿到的每盏灯笼都会把一些冰面重新扫干净。雪盖满冰面时，这一夜就结束了，然后是结算。"

msgid "The snow starts light and settles faster than you can stop it."
msgstr "雪一开始下得很小，积得比你清得还快。"

msgid "Each lantern you take sweeps some of the ice clear again."
msgstr "你拿到的每盏灯笼都会把一些冰面重新扫干净。"

msgid ""
"When the snow covers the ice, the night is over, and the results follow."
msgstr "雪盖满冰面时，这一夜就结束了，然后是结算。"

msgid ""
"The practice skate, the lantern skate, the Frost Fair and the midnight "
"skate have no settling snow. Each has its own end instead."
msgstr "练习滑冰、灯笼滑冰、Frost Fair和午夜滑冰都没有积雪。它们各有各的结束方式。"

msgid ""
"The practice skate, the lantern skate, the Frost Fair and the midnight "
"skate have no settling snow."
msgstr "练习滑冰、灯笼滑冰、Frost Fair和午夜滑冰都没有积雪。"

msgid "Each has its own end instead."
msgstr "它们各有各的结束方式。"

msgid "Drifts and thin ice"
msgstr "雪堆和薄冰"

msgid ""
"Drifts of snow lie on the ice between some lanterns. Skate into one and you "
"slow down for a moment, lean more slowly, and your line starts again."
msgstr "有些灯笼之间的冰面上堆着雪堆。撞进雪堆会让你慢一会儿，倾身也变慢，你的连串会重新开始。"

msgid "Drifts of snow lie on the ice between some lanterns."
msgstr "有些灯笼之间的冰面上堆着雪堆。"

msgid ""
"Skate into one and you slow down for a moment, lean more slowly, and your "
"line starts again."
msgstr "撞进雪堆会让你慢一会儿，倾身也变慢，你的连串会重新开始。"

msgid ""
"On the mill pond and the long lake, some patches of ice are thin. Skate "
"onto thin ice and you stumble for a moment. You cannot lean while "
"stumbling. Your line starts again, and more snow settles on the ice. A "
"drift or thin patch always comes up in time to lean round it. H says which "
"way to lean."
msgstr ""
"在磨坊池塘和长湖上，有些地方的冰很薄。滑到薄冰上会让你踉跄一下。踉跄时不能倾身。你的连串会重新开始，冰面上也会积更多雪。雪堆或薄冰总是来得及让你倾身绕开"
"。按H说出该往哪边倾身。"

msgid "On the mill pond and the long lake, some patches of ice are thin."
msgstr "在磨坊池塘和长湖上，有些地方的冰很薄。"

msgid "Skate onto thin ice and you stumble for a moment."
msgstr "滑到薄冰上会让你踉跄一下。"

msgid "You cannot lean while stumbling."
msgstr "踉跄时不能倾身。"

msgid "Your line starts again, and more snow settles on the ice."
msgstr "你的连串会重新开始，冰面上也会积更多雪。"

msgid "A drift or thin patch always comes up in time to lean round it."
msgstr "雪堆或薄冰总是来得及让你倾身绕开。"

msgid "H says which way to lean."
msgstr "按H说出该往哪边倾身。"

msgid ""
"On the ponds and at the Frost Fair, your partner skates with you, a little "
"ahead. They skate toward each lantern and round every drift and patch of "
"thin ice. If you are unsure where to go, follow your partner."
msgstr ""
"在池塘上和Frost Fair，你的搭档会和你一起滑，在你前面一点。搭档会滑向每盏灯笼，绕开每个雪堆和每块薄冰。不确定往哪里去时，就跟着你的搭档。"

msgid ""
"On the ponds and at the Frost Fair, your partner skates with you, a little "
"ahead."
msgstr "在池塘上和Frost Fair，你的搭档会和你一起滑，在你前面一点。"

msgid ""
"They skate toward each lantern and round every drift and patch of thin ice."
msgstr "搭档会滑向每盏灯笼，绕开每个雪堆和每块薄冰。"

msgid "If you are unsure where to go, follow your partner."
msgstr "不确定往哪里去时，就跟着你的搭档。"

msgid "Spins"
msgstr "旋转"

msgid ""
"Between lanterns, you can spin. Hold Space and the spin starts to wind. "
"Once it is ready, let go of Space to land it. A landed spin is worth "
"points: 3 on clear ice, and more as the snow lies deeper, up to 5."
msgstr ""
"在两盏灯笼之间，你可以旋转。按住Space，旋转开始蓄力。准备好后，松开Space完成落地。成功落地的旋转可以得分：干净的冰面上3分，雪积得越深分越多，"
"最多5分。"

msgid "Between lanterns, you can spin."
msgstr "在两盏灯笼之间，你可以旋转。"

msgid "Hold Space and the spin starts to wind."
msgstr "按住Space，旋转开始蓄力。"

msgid "Once it is ready, let go of Space to land it."
msgstr "准备好后，松开Space完成落地。"

msgid ""
"A landed spin is worth points: 3 on clear ice, and more as the snow lies "
"deeper, up to 5."
msgstr "成功落地的旋转可以得分：干净的冰面上3分，雪积得越深分越多，最多5分。"

msgid ""
"Let go too soon and it is only a stride, worth nothing. Hold it too long "
"and you wobble, which breaks your line. You cannot lean while you spin, so "
"spin when the next lantern is still far off. You can land one spin for each "
"lantern that passes."
msgstr ""
"松开得太早，就只是一步滑行，不得分。按得太久，你会摇晃，连串就断了。旋转时不能倾身，所以要趁下一盏灯笼还很远时旋转。每经过一盏灯笼，你可以完成一次旋转。"

msgid "Let go too soon and it is only a stride, worth nothing."
msgstr "松开得太早，就只是一步滑行，不得分。"

msgid "Hold it too long and you wobble, which breaks your line."
msgstr "按得太久，你会摇晃，连串就断了。"

msgid ""
"You cannot lean while you spin, so spin when the next lantern is still far "
"off."
msgstr "旋转时不能倾身，所以要趁下一盏灯笼还很远时旋转。"

msgid "You can land one spin for each lantern that passes."
msgstr "每经过一盏灯笼，你可以完成一次旋转。"

msgid "The ponds and stars"
msgstr "池塘和星星"

msgid ""
"Play, on the title, skates the newest pond without a star. Choose a pond "
"lists all three with their stars and bests. A star on one pond opens the "
"next."
msgstr "标题菜单上的开始会去还没拿到星星的最新池塘。选择池塘会列出全部三个池塘，以及它们的星星和最高分。在一个池塘拿到一颗星，就会解锁下一个。"

msgid "Play, on the title, skates the newest pond without a star."
msgstr "标题菜单上的开始会去还没拿到星星的最新池塘。"

msgid "Choose a pond lists all three with their stars and bests."
msgstr "选择池塘会列出全部三个池塘，以及它们的星星和最高分。"

msgid "A star on one pond opens the next."
msgstr "在一个池塘拿到一颗星，就会解锁下一个。"

msgid ""
"The village pond: drifts here and there, and no thin ice. Open from the "
"start."
msgstr "村里的池塘：零星有些雪堆，没有薄冰。一开始就开放。"

msgid "The village pond: drifts here and there, and no thin ice."
msgstr "村里的池塘：零星有些雪堆，没有薄冰。"

msgid "The mill pond: thin ice joins the drifts."
msgstr "磨坊池塘：雪堆之外还有薄冰。"

msgid "The long lake: lanterns come faster, and the patches are wider."
msgstr "长湖：灯笼来得更快，薄冰也更宽。"

msgid ""
"Each pond has three score targets, one for each star. Choose a pond reads "
"its targets."
msgstr "每个池塘有三个得分目标，每颗星一个。选择池塘会读出它的目标。"

msgid "Each pond has three score targets, one for each star."
msgstr "每个池塘有三个得分目标，每颗星一个。"

msgid "Choose a pond reads its targets."
msgstr "选择池塘会读出它的目标。"

msgid "The lantern skate"
msgstr "灯笼滑冰"

msgid ""
"Every evening, from 4 in the afternoon to 9 at night by your clock, the "
"lantern skate is lit. Its lanterns light in pairs, one just after the "
"other, and you take the one that lit first. Taking the second breaks your "
"line. The lanterns are the same for every player that day. Taken in order, "
"the lanterns that lit first play the day's tune. The skate ends after its "
"last pair."
msgstr ""
"每天傍晚，按你的时钟从下午4点到晚上9点，灯笼滑冰会亮起来。它的灯笼成对亮起，一盏紧跟着另一盏，你要拿先亮的那盏。拿了第二盏会打断连串。那天每位玩家遇到"
"的灯笼都一样。按顺序拿到先亮的灯笼，就会奏出当天的曲子。最后一对灯笼过后，滑冰就结束了。"

msgid ""
"Every evening, from 4 in the afternoon to 9 at night by your clock, the "
"lantern skate is lit."
msgstr "每天傍晚，按你的时钟从下午4点到晚上9点，灯笼滑冰会亮起来。"

msgid ""
"Its lanterns light in pairs, one just after the other, and you take the one "
"that lit first."
msgstr "它的灯笼成对亮起，一盏紧跟着另一盏，你要拿先亮的那盏。"

msgid "Taking the second breaks your line."
msgstr "拿了第二盏会打断连串。"

msgid "The lanterns are the same for every player that day."
msgstr "那天每位玩家遇到的灯笼都一样。"

msgid "Taken in order, the lanterns that lit first play the day's tune."
msgstr "按顺序拿到先亮的灯笼，就会奏出当天的曲子。"

msgid "The skate ends after its last pair."
msgstr "最后一对灯笼过后，滑冰就结束了。"

msgid ""
"On the winter solstice, the river freezes and the fair sets up on the ice. "
"The Frost Fair is a long skate down the river, past the stalls along the "
"banks, with your partner beside you. It ends at the far bridge."
msgstr ""
"冬至那天，河面结冰，集市就搭在冰上。Frost Fair是沿着河的一段长距离滑冰，经过两岸的摊位，你的搭档就在身边。它在远处的桥那里结束。"

msgid ""
"On the winter solstice, the river freezes and the fair sets up on the ice."
msgstr "冬至那天，河面结冰，集市就搭在冰上。"

msgid ""
"The Frost Fair is a long skate down the river, past the stalls along the "
"banks, with your partner beside you."
msgstr "Frost Fair是沿着河的一段长距离滑冰，经过两岸的摊位，你的搭档就在身边。"

msgid "It ends at the far bridge."
msgstr "它在远处的桥那里结束。"

msgid ""
"A star at the Frost Fair on its day earns that winter's ribbon. Once you "
"have skated it on its day, the fair stays open for the rest of that winter."
msgstr "在Frost Fair当天拿到一颗星，就能得到那个冬天的绶带。在当天滑过之后，集市会在那个冬天余下的日子里一直开放。"

msgid "A star at the Frost Fair on its day earns that winter's ribbon."
msgstr "在Frost Fair当天拿到一颗星，就能得到那个冬天的绶带。"

msgid ""
"Once you have skated it on its day, the fair stays open for the rest of "
"that winter."
msgstr "在当天滑过之后，集市会在那个冬天余下的日子里一直开放。"

msgid "The midnight skate"
msgstr "午夜滑冰"

msgid ""
"On New Year's Eve, from 11 at night to 1 in the morning by your clock, the "
"midnight skate opens. Skate the village pond until midnight, when the skate "
"stops for the fireworks."
msgstr "新年前夜，按你的时钟从晚上11点到凌晨1点，午夜滑冰会开放。在村里的池塘上滑到午夜，那时滑冰会停下来看烟花。"

msgid ""
"On New Year's Eve, from 11 at night to 1 in the morning by your clock, the "
"midnight skate opens."
msgstr "新年前夜，按你的时钟从晚上11点到凌晨1点，午夜滑冰会开放。"

msgid ""
"Skate the village pond until midnight, when the skate stops for the "
"fireworks."
msgstr "在村里的池塘上滑到午夜，那时滑冰会停下来看烟花。"

msgid "Keeping the game all year"
msgstr "全年保留这个游戏"

msgid ""
"Snowfall Skate is listed in Seasonal games from 27 November through the "
"winter, until the end of February, and stays two more weeks, through March "
"14. Start a skate or a practice in that time and the game is yours to keep, "
"even if you leave early: after the winter it stays in the Cozy games. "
"Earlier play counts too, and stars still open later ponds. The Frost Fair "
"returns the next winter."
msgstr ""
"Snowfall "
"Skate从11月27日起列在季节游戏里，贯穿整个冬天，直到2月底，之后再留两周，到3月14日为止。在这段时间里开始一次滑冰或练习，这个游戏就永远归你了"
"，即使你提前离开也一样：冬天过后，它会留在休闲游戏里。更早的游玩也算数，星星照样能解锁后面的池塘。Frost Fair下个冬天会回来。"

msgid ""
"Snowfall Skate is listed in Seasonal games from 27 November through the "
"winter, until the end of February, and stays two more weeks, through March "
"14."
msgstr "Snowfall Skate从11月27日起列在季节游戏里，贯穿整个冬天，直到2月底，之后再留两周，到3月14日为止。"

msgid ""
"Start a skate or a practice in that time and the game is yours to keep, "
"even if you leave early: after the winter it stays in the Cozy games."
msgstr "在这段时间里开始一次滑冰或练习，这个游戏就永远归你了，即使你提前离开也一样：冬天过后，它会留在休闲游戏里。"

msgid "Earlier play counts too, and stars still open later ponds."
msgstr "更早的游玩也算数，星星照样能解锁后面的池塘。"

msgid "The Frost Fair returns the next winter."
msgstr "Frost Fair下个冬天会回来。"

msgid "Practice and the tutorial"
msgstr "练习和教程"

msgid ""
"The tutorial teaches leaning, lanterns, drifts and spins on a slow pond. "
"The practice skate is the village pond with no snow and no score, and every "
"lantern's lane is named as it lights. Use it to learn the lanes."
msgstr "教程会在一个慢速池塘上教你倾身、灯笼、雪堆和旋转。练习滑冰是没有雪、不计分的村里池塘，每盏灯笼亮起时都会说出它的冰道。用它来熟悉冰道。"

msgid ""
"The tutorial teaches leaning, lanterns, drifts and spins on a slow pond."
msgstr "教程会在一个慢速池塘上教你倾身、灯笼、雪堆和旋转。"

msgid ""
"The practice skate is the village pond with no snow and no score, and every "
"lantern's lane is named as it lights."
msgstr "练习滑冰是没有雪、不计分的村里池塘，每盏灯笼亮起时都会说出它的冰道。"

msgid "Use it to learn the lanes."
msgstr "用它来熟悉冰道。"

msgid ""
"Challenges are the same ice for every player in the period. Tonight's pond "
"is the mill pond, with drifts and thin ice, and changes every day. Thin ice "
"week is the long lake, with thin ice all the way, and changes every week. "
"The midwinter skate is the long lake in heavy snow, where each lantern "
"keeps less of the ice clear, and changes every month."
msgstr ""
"挑战期间，每位玩家滑的冰都一样。今晚的池塘是磨坊池塘，有雪堆和薄冰，每天更换。薄冰周是长湖，全程都有薄冰，每周更换。仲冬滑冰是大雪中的长湖，每盏灯笼能保"
"持干净的冰面更少，每月更换。"

msgid "Challenges are the same ice for every player in the period."
msgstr "挑战期间，每位玩家滑的冰都一样。"

msgid ""
"Tonight's pond is the mill pond, with drifts and thin ice, and changes "
"every day."
msgstr "今晚的池塘是磨坊池塘，有雪堆和薄冰，每天更换。"

msgid ""
"Thin ice week is the long lake, with thin ice all the way, and changes "
"every week."
msgstr "薄冰周是长湖，全程都有薄冰，每周更换。"

msgid ""
"The midwinter skate is the long lake in heavy snow, where each lantern "
"keeps less of the ice clear, and changes every month."
msgstr "仲冬滑冰是大雪中的长湖，每盏灯笼能保持干净的冰面更少，每月更换。"

msgid "The status key"
msgstr "状态键"

msgid ""
"S gives nearby hazards, the next lantern's lane, whether a spin is ready, "
"and where you are. Press S again straight away for your score, your line "
"and how deep the snow lies."
msgstr "按S说出附近的障碍、下一盏灯笼的冰道、旋转是否准备好，以及你在哪里。马上再按一次S，听你的得分、连串和积雪有多深。"

msgid ""
"S gives nearby hazards, the next lantern's lane, whether a spin is ready, "
"and where you are."
msgstr "按S说出附近的障碍、下一盏灯笼的冰道、旋转是否准备好，以及你在哪里。"

msgid ""
"Press S again straight away for your score, your line and how deep the snow "
"lies."
msgstr "马上再按一次S，听你的得分、连串和积雪有多深。"

msgid ""
"Sound check, on the title, plays the lanterns, obstacles, partner and spin "
"cues. Each row explains the cue and plays it as you would hear it on the "
"ice."
msgstr "标题菜单上的音效试听会播放灯笼、障碍、搭档和旋转的提示声。每一行会说明提示声，并按你在冰上听到的样子播放。"

msgid ""
"Sound check, on the title, plays the lanterns, obstacles, partner and spin "
"cues."
msgstr "标题菜单上的音效试听会播放灯笼、障碍、搭档和旋转的提示声。"

msgid ""
"Each row explains the cue and plays it as you would hear it on the ice."
msgstr "每一行会说明提示声，并按你在冰上听到的样子播放。"

msgid ""
"Space: push off. Once away, hold it to spin, and let go once the spin is "
"ready."
msgstr "Space：蹬冰出发。出发后按住它旋转，旋转准备好后松开。"

msgid "Space: push off."
msgstr "Space：蹬冰出发。"

msgid "Once away, hold it to spin, and let go once the spin is ready."
msgstr "出发后按住它旋转，旋转准备好后松开。"

msgid "Left and Right: hold to lean that way."
msgstr "Left和Right：按住往那边倾身。"

msgid "S: the status. Press it again straight away for more."
msgstr "S：状态。马上再按一次听更多。"

msgid "S: the status."
msgstr "S：状态。"

msgid "Press it again straight away for more."
msgstr "马上再按一次听更多。"

msgid ""
"H: a hint on where to lean. Before you push off, it plays what you will "
"meet on the ice."
msgstr "H：提示往哪边倾身。蹬冰出发前，它会播放你在冰上会遇到的东西。"

msgid "H: a hint on where to lean."
msgstr "H：提示往哪边倾身。"

msgid "Before you push off, it plays what you will meet on the ice."
msgstr "蹬冰出发前，它会播放你在冰上会遇到的东西。"

msgid "F1: help."
msgstr "F1：帮助。"

msgid "Tonight's pond"
msgstr "今晚的池塘"

msgid "Thin ice week"
msgstr "薄冰周"

msgid "Midwinter skate"
msgstr "仲冬滑冰"

msgid ""
"The mill pond, with drifts and thin ice, the same for everyone tonight. "
"Skate until the snow covers the ice."
msgstr "磨坊池塘，有雪堆和薄冰，今晚每个人都一样。一直滑到雪盖满冰面。"

msgid ""
"The long lake, with thin ice all the way, the same for everyone this week. "
"Skate until the snow covers the ice."
msgstr "长湖，全程都有薄冰，本周每个人都一样。一直滑到雪盖满冰面。"

msgid ""
"The long lake in a heavy snowfall, the same for everyone this month. Each "
"lantern keeps less of the ice clear."
msgstr "大雪中的长湖，本月每个人都一样。每盏灯笼能保持干净的冰面更少。"

msgid "the mill pond, drifts and thin ice"
msgstr "磨坊池塘，雪堆和薄冰"

msgid "the long lake, thin ice all the way"
msgstr "长湖，全程薄冰"

msgid "the long lake in a heavy snowfall"
msgstr "大雪中的长湖"

msgid "Your first try."
msgstr "你的第一次尝试。"

