msgid "Opening the Snowfall Skate challenge."
msgstr "正在打开Snowfall Skate挑战。"

msgid "The Frost Fair"
msgstr "Frost Fair"

msgid "Lantern skate"
msgstr "灯笼滑冰"

msgid "The river is frozen, and the fair is out on the ice today."
msgstr "河面结冰了，今天集市就摆在冰上。"

msgid "Midnight skate"
msgstr "午夜滑冰"

msgid "Snowfall Skate"
msgstr "Snowfall Skate"

msgid ""
"A winter special. Skate a frozen pond at night, taking lanterns as they "
"light, while the snow comes down. Play once, even in practice, to keep it "
"all year."
msgstr "一个冬季特别篇。夜里下着雪，在结冰的池塘上滑冰，灯笼一亮就去拿。玩一次，即使是练习，就能全年保留它。"

msgid ""
"Skate a frozen pond at night, taking lanterns as they light, while the snow "
"comes down. The Frost Fair opens in winter."
msgstr "夜里下着雪，在结冰的池塘上滑冰，灯笼一亮就去拿。Frost Fair在冬天开放。"

msgid ""
"Snowfall Skate is yours to keep. After the winter, it moves to the Cozy "
"games."
msgstr "Snowfall Skate永远归你了。冬天过后，它会移到休闲游戏里。"

msgid ""
"A winter special. Skate a frozen pond at night, taking lanterns as they "
"light, while the snow comes down."
msgstr "一个冬季特别篇。夜里下着雪，在结冰的池塘上滑冰，灯笼一亮就去拿。"

