msgid ""
"The full moon has set, and the full moon pad is closed until the next full "
"moon"
msgstr "满月落下了，满月着陆台关闭，直到下一次满月"

msgid ""
"Moon landing day is over, and the Tranquility pad is closed until next July"
msgstr "登月纪念日过去了，静海着陆台关闭，直到明年7月"

msgid "the next full moon"
