msgid ""
"{sentence_start} sends a sonar ping. Everything nearby echoes from its true "
"direction, and far things echo later. Ping now."
msgstr "按{sentence_start}发出一次声呐。附近的每样东西都会从它真实的方向传回回声，远的东西回声来得更晚。现在发出声呐。"

msgid "The chest is on your right."
