msgstr "按住{sentence_start}和{r}转动潜艇。松开时会说出你的航向。转到宝箱在正前方，再发出声呐确认。"

msgid "The chest is ahead of you."
msgstr "宝箱在你前方。"

msgid ""
"Mines warn you when you are near, and touching one costs hull. One lies "
"south of you. Ping to find it."
msgstr "你接近水雷时它会警告你，碰到一颗会损失船体值。你南边有一颗。发出声呐找到它。"

msgid "You found that mine already, the hard way."
msgstr "那颗水雷你已经找到了，用的是吃苦头的方式。"

msgid "That was the mine."
msgstr "那就是水雷。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Swim back to it."
msgstr "游回去。"

#. placeholders: {s}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Treasure is safe once you surface at the boat's bell, and {s} says where it "
"is."
msgstr "在船的钟那里浮出水面后，宝藏就安全了，按{s}说出钟在哪里。"

#. placeholders: {s}
msgid ""
"Treasure is safe once you surface at the boat's bell, and {s} says where it "
"is. Swim back to it."
msgstr "在船的钟那里浮出水面后，宝藏就安全了，按{s}说出钟在哪里。游回去。"

