msgstr "礼物分拣第{DAILY_SHIFT}班的一班。在时钟走完前分拣完整张订单。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Sort the whole order before the clock runs out."
msgstr "在时钟走完前分拣完整张订单。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
