#. placeholders: {WEEKLY_SHIFTS}, {WEEKLY_SHIFTS2}, {WEEKLY_STACK}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Gift Sort shifts {WEEKLY_SHIFTS} to {WEEKLY_SHIFTS2}, then stack "
"{WEEKLY_STACK} at the Wish Desk."
msgstr "礼物分拣第{WEEKLY_SHIFTS}到{WEEKLY_SHIFTS2}班，然后是心愿桌的第{WEEKLY_STACK}摞。"

#. placeholders: {WEEKLY_SHIFTS}, {WEEKLY_SHIFTS2}, {WEEKLY_STACK}
msgid ""
"Gift Sort shifts {WEEKLY_SHIFTS} to {WEEKLY_SHIFTS2}, then stack "
"{WEEKLY_STACK} at the Wish Desk. Both scores add up. The twist is on the "
"belt."
msgstr ""
"礼物分拣第{WEEKLY_SHIFTS}到{WEEKLY_SHIFTS2}班，然后是心愿桌的第{WEEKLY_STACK}摞。两部分得分相加。变化在传送"
"带上。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The twist is on the belt."
msgstr "变化在传送带上。"

#. placeholders: {MONTHLY_STACKS}, {MONTHLY_STACKS2}
msgid ""
"Stacks {MONTHLY_STACKS} to {MONTHLY_STACKS2} at the Wish Desk, one after "
"another."
msgstr "心愿桌的第{MONTHLY_STACKS}到{MONTHLY_STACKS2}摞，一摞接一摞。"

