msgid "Winter Wonderland"
msgstr "Winter Wonderland"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a challenge, Enter reads its briefing, Escape goes back. "
"Every player gets the same runs: a new daily each day, a weekly each Monday "
"and a monthly each month."
msgstr ""
"Up和Down选择挑战，Enter读出简报，Escape返回。每个玩家的内容都一样：每天一个新的每日挑战，每周一一个每周挑战，每月一个每月挑战。"

msgid "Opening the Winter Wonderland challenge."
msgstr "正在打开Winter Wonderland挑战。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "A bar counts you in."
msgstr "一小节带你进入。"

#. placeholders: {primary}, {key}, {key2}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Bells are {primary}, the drum is {key}, the horn is {key2}."
msgstr "铃铛是{primary}，鼓是{key}，号是{key2}。"

#. placeholders: {name}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Midnight Countdown: {name}."
msgstr "午夜倒计时：{name}。"

#. placeholders: {name}, {primary}, {key}, {key2}
msgid ""
"Midnight Countdown: {name}. Ten minutes to midnight, and the full orchestra "
"is here from the first call. The band plays a one-bar call; answer it in "
"the next bar, on the same beats. Bells are {primary}, the drum is {key}, "
"the horn is {key2}. The party starts at full energy; misses drain it. Press "
"{primary} to start. A bar counts you in."
msgstr ""
"午夜倒计时：{name}。午夜前十分钟，整个乐团从第一段呼叫就在了。乐队奏一小节呼叫；你在下一小节、用同样的拍子回应。铃铛是{primary}，鼓是{k"
"ey}，号是{key2}。派对开始时活力满满；漏掉会消耗活力。按{primary}开始。一小节带你进入。"

#. placeholders: {primary}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Press {primary} to start."
msgstr "按{primary}开始。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Ten minutes to midnight, and the full orchestra is here from the first call."
msgstr "午夜前十分钟，整个乐团从第一段呼叫就在了。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"The band plays a one-bar call; answer it in the next bar, on the same beats."
msgstr "乐队奏一小节呼叫；你在下一小节、用同样的拍子回应。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The party starts at full energy; misses drain it."
msgstr "派对开始时活力满满；漏掉会消耗活力。"

#. placeholders: {level}, {name}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Night {level}: {name}."
msgstr "第{level}夜：{name}。"

#. placeholders: {level}, {name}, {sentence_start}
msgid "Night {level}: {name}. {sentence_start} starts."
msgstr "第{level}夜：{name}。{sentence_start}开始。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} starts."
msgstr "{sentence_start}开始。"

msgid " This is practice: the party never fizzles, and nothing is saved."
msgstr "这是练习：派对永远不会冷场，什么也不保存。"

#. placeholders: {practice}, {primary}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Good answers lift the party's energy; misses drain it.{practice} Press "
"{primary} to start."
msgstr "回应得好会提升派对活力；漏掉会消耗活力。{practice}按{primary}开始。"

#. placeholders: {level}, {name}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Midnight Countdown, night {level}: {name}."
msgstr "午夜倒计时，第{level}夜：{name}。"

#. placeholders: {level}, {name}, {primary}, {practice}
msgid ""
"Midnight Countdown, night {level}: {name}. Ten minutes to midnight. The "
"band plays a one-bar call on bells; answer it in the next bar, on the same "
"beats, with {primary}. Good answers lift the party's energy; misses drain "
"it.{practice} Press {primary} to start. A bar counts you in."
msgstr ""
"午夜倒计时，第{level}夜：{name}。午夜前十分钟。乐队用铃铛奏一小节呼叫；你在下一小节、用同样的拍子，用{primary}回应。回应得好会提升"
"派对活力；漏掉会消耗活力。{practice}按{primary}开始。一小节带你进入。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Ten minutes to midnight."
msgstr "午夜前十分钟。"

#. placeholders: {primary}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"The band plays a one-bar call on bells; answer it in the next bar, on the "
"same beats, with {primary}."
msgstr "乐队用铃铛奏一小节呼叫；你在下一小节、用同样的拍子，用{primary}回应。"

